                details: "The policy now watches the real wr.remove primitive, and mounted tests drive both keys, partial travel, full authorization, and the refused-delete path. The branch delete no longer sneaks past the guard wearing a handler-name moustache.\n\n政策而家會直接望實真正嘅 wr.remove，掛載測試亦會實際扭兩條匙、試半程滑桿、完成授權，同驗證刪除被拒絕嘅路徑。今次分支刪除戴住假鬚都走唔甩喇。",
