                subject: "Screenshots: reach the Pages tab through overflow when it does not fit",
                details: "The Screenshots job's hard assertion started failing on \"Pages publishing\nscreen\" and the obvious suspects - the repeated config:readFolder errors\nand the lang/none.conf 404 in the same log - turned out to be unrelated\nnoise. The real story: a fresh profile seeds all eleven of the shell's\ntabs at once, and at this harness's 1280x800 capture viewport only the\nfirst seven ordinary tabs fit before TabStrip.vue's own overflow control\ntakes the rest - \"Publish to Pages\" is the ninth. That is the tab strip\ndoing exactly what it is built to do; the harness just never learned to\nopen the drawer. A plain `[role=\"tab\"]` lookup for the visible strip was\nnever going to find a tab that was sitting one click further away, so it\ntimed out and read as a missing screen instead of a moved one.\n\nConfirmed on a real Windows Electron launch, not only reasoned about:\nthe same timeout reproduces there, and the same fix clears it, so this\nwas never a Linux-only quirk - the overflow mechanism behaves\nidentically on both platforms and only the test's helper was short a\nstep. Added `openShellTab()`, which tries the direct tab first and\nfalls back to the overflow control's own menu exactly the way a person\nwould, scoped so it cannot be confused with Settings' or the options\neditor's own copies of the same control. A full local run now clears\nthe \"Pages publishing screen\" gap entirely; the one remaining local skip\n(Changelog viewer) is a pre-existing, map-less-Windows-machine artifact\nthat CI's own log never reported, so it is left alone.\n\n分頁一直冇唔見,佢淨係匿埋咗。截圖測試喺1280px闊度想撳「Publish to Pages」\n分頁,但十一個分頁入面佢排第九,前面得七個位,後面嘅早就摺埋咗入分頁列自己\n嗰個「擺唔落,撳嚟睇」摺疊掣度 - 呢個係分頁列本身嘅正常行為,唔係應用程式\n壞咗。以前個測試淨係識喺明面嘅分頁度揾,揾唔到就當成個畫面唔見咗,其實佢淨\n係行遠咗一步。喺Windows開返個真Electron試過,一樣撞到嗰個timeout,證明呢\n單嘢兩邊平台都一樣,同Linux冇關係。而家加咗個 `openShellTab()`,見到分頁就\n直接撳,唔見就開返個摺疊掣揾,同真人操作一模一樣,仲刻意同Settings、設定編\n輯器自己嗰兩份摺疊掣分返清楚,唔會撳錯。本機跑晒成個測試套件,「Pages\npublishing screen」呢個gap已經冇晒;剩返嗰個Changelog viewer本機skip係呢\npart冇裝真地圖先有嘅舊問題,CI條log從來冇報過,所以冇郁佢。",
