                date: "2026-08-06T04:33:05-04:00",
                subject: "Give Electron its own GTK library and prove its binary exists before launching",
                details: "The screenshots job failed with \"electron.launch: Process failed to launch!\"\nand exit code 127, which reads like a missing file and here meant a missing\nlibrary: Electron needs libgtk-3.so.0 and this runner's image does not carry\nit. The neighbouring step that installs Chromium's dependencies does not cover\nthis, because Electron's runtime needs are its own - a distinction the tidy\nproximity of those two steps invites everyone to get wrong exactly once.\n\nAdded a check-first install for that library, and separately a guard for the\nother way this project has produced a 127 before: a package manager's\ninstall-script gate leaving the electron package on disk with no binary in\nelectron/dist. That guard re-runs the package's own install.js and, if the\nbinary is still absent afterwards, fails naming the difference between a\ndownload that genuinely failed and an install step that was merely skipped.\n\nTwenty-three of the twenty-four screenshot tests never ran, all waiting on that\nfirst launch - so this is one cause with twenty-four names, not twenty-four\nproblems.\n\n個 screenshots job 死喺「Electron 起唔到」,錯誤碼 127 睇落似搵唔到檔案,實情\n係搵唔到 libgtk-3.so.0——Electron 自己要嘅 library,同隔籬嗰步幫 Chromium 裝\n嗰堆唔同。兩步排到咁近,實有人以為裝咗一次就兩邊都掂,呢個誤會一人一次走唔甩。\n順手補埋另一種會出 127 嘅情況:套件管理員嘅安裝腳本閘門有時會令 electron 個\npackage 喺度但 dist 入面冇執行檔;而家會自己再行一次佢個 install.js,再唔得就\n即刻嘈,順便分清楚「真係下載失敗」同「安裝步驟俾人跳咗」。\n廿四個截圖測試有廿三個根本冇行過,全部等緊第一次啟動——即係一個病因二十四個名。",
                category: "build",
                areas: ["build", "docs"],
                files: 2,
