                date: "2026-08-06T04:04:04-04:00",
                subject: "Point the Windows job's bash steps at Git Bash instead of WSL",
                details: "Three steps in the installer job declare shell: bash, which was enough on\nGitHub's windows-latest image and is not enough here. The runner resolves bash\nfrom PATH, and Windows ships C:\\Windows\\System32\\bash.exe - the WSL launcher,\nnot a shell. With no WSL distribution installed it exits 1 after helpfully\nprinting instructions for installing one, which is a confusing thing to read\nunder a step called \"Stage the CLI jar to bundle\".\n\nGit for Windows is already on the machine, so a first step prepends its bin\ndirectory via GITHUB_PATH and the three bash scripts stay exactly as they are.\nIt checks the three usual install locations and fails with the real reason if\nit finds none, rather than staying quiet and letting the same WSL error\nresurface three steps later wearing a different step name.\n\n呢個 job 有三步寫住 shell: bash,喺 GitHub 部機冇事,喺自己部機就出事:Windows\n本身有個 System32\\bash.exe,佢係 WSL 嘅入口,唔係 shell,而部機又冇裝過任何\n發行版,於是佢好心咁教你點裝 WSL 然後 exit 1——喺一個叫「Stage the CLI jar」\n嘅步驟下面睇到呢段嘢,幾難聯想到係咩事。部機本身有 Git for Windows,所以加一步\n將佢個 bin 排到前面就搞掂,三段 bash 一個字都唔使改。搵唔到就即刻嘈,唔好扮冇事\n等三步之後換個名再炸多次。",
                category: "build",
                areas: ["build"],
                files: 1,
