                subject: "Gate the three real-Windows CurseForge/Bedrock discovery tests to win32",
                details: "These three built a real fixture tree with mkdtemp/mkdir/writeFile and\nasked for it back through listMinecraftFolders({ platform: \"win32\" }),\nwhich looked like a clean, self-contained, cross-platform test. It is\nnot: locations.ts deliberately builds the win32 candidate with\npath.win32.join so the string itself is honest about Windows from any\nrunner, but mounts.ts then hands that same backslash-joined string\nstraight to real fs.lstat/fs.opendir. On Windows a backslash is a real\nseparator and it resolves. On the POSIX runner this suite now also runs\non, a backslash is an ordinary filename character, so the real,\nfixture-built directories -- created with this runner's own forward-\nslash join -- can never be found again through it. No fixture rewrite\ncloses that gap; a win32-shaped nested tree cannot be created or found\non a filesystem where \"\\\" is not a separator. Gated to run only where\nthey can be telling the truth, the same real-machine/opt-in shape\nbedrock/convert.e2e.test.ts and render/orchestrator.realJvm.test.ts\nalready use, just keyed on the platform instead of an env flag. The\nrecursive scanning underneath (detectLauncherRoot) and the \"only offer\nit when it is really there\" loop it feeds are already proven on every\nplatform elsewhere in this same file and in launcherRoots.test.ts.\n\n呢三條測試自己用 mkdtemp/mkdir/writeFile 起咗一棵真樹，再經\nlistMinecraftFolders({ platform: \"win32\" }) 攞返嚟睇，睇落好似一個\n乾淨、自給自足、跨平台嘅測試，但其實唔係：locations.ts 專登用\npath.win32.join 起條 win32 候選路徑，等呢條字串喺邊部機都老實咁答\n「Windows 會係點」，但係 mounts.ts 跟住就將呢條用反斜杠砌埋嘅字串\n直接掉畀真正嘅 fs.lstat/fs.opendir。喺 Windows 度反斜杠係正牌分隔符，\n搵得返；但依家呢個測試套裝仲要喺度跑嘅 POSIX 機度，反斜杠淨係普通\n檔名字元，於是嗰啲用呢部機自己嗰種正斜杠 join 起返嚟嘅真資料夾，\n永遠都搵佢唔返。點樣重寫個 fixture 都補唔返呢個窿：一棵 win32 形狀\n嘅巢狀目錄樹，喺一個「\\」唔係分隔符嘅檔案系統度，根本起唔到亦搵唔\n返。而家改成淨係喺真係answ得到嘅平台先至跑，同\nbedrock/convert.e2e.test.ts 同 render/orchestrator.realJvm.test.ts\n嗰種「真機、自願opt-in」寫法一樣，淨係唔係用環境變數嚟揸，而係睇\n平台本身。底層嗰個遞迴掃描（detectLauncherRoot）同埋「真係有先至\n攞出嚟」嗰個 loop，喺呢個檔案自己其他測試同 launcherRoots.test.ts\n入面早就喺唔同平台度證明過。",
