                subject: "Give the test run the same heap the typecheck step just needed",
                details: "Raising the typecheck ceiling moved the failure one step down: the very next\nrun died in test:ci with \"Ineffective mark-compacts near heap limit\" instead.\nSame cause, different command. Over eight thousand tests across nearly six\nhundred files, on a machine with less spare memory than the hosted runners this\nsuite grew up on.\n\nThe worker pool is already capped at two forks in vitest's own config for\nexactly this reason, so the fix is the ceiling rather than the concurrency. A\nchild process inherits NODE_OPTIONS, so setting it on the step lifts the main\nprocess and its forks together.\n\n頭先幫 typecheck 加大記憶體,個問題就順住條路行落一步:今次輪到 test:ci 爆。\n同一個死因,唔同指令啫。成八千幾個測試、近六百個檔案,喺一部冇 GitHub 部機咁鬆動\n嘅機器度行。vitest 早就已經限死兩個 fork,所以要郁嘅係上限而唔係並行數;\nNODE_OPTIONS 會由父程序傳落 fork,所以寫喺呢一步就一次過搞掂兩邊。",
                category: "build",
                areas: ["build"],
                files: 1,
