                details: "The playful levels for rendersInProgress.blurb, .homeTile, .empty.checking,\n.empty.none, .empty.noMatch and .bulk.cancelExplain had quietly rewritten\ntheir way past 45 required facts across English and Cantonese. The worst\ncase: homeTile's levels 4-5, in both languages, replaced \"this computer, a\ncontainer, or GitHub's runners\" and \"this app did not start this session\"\nwith a vague \"wherever it is running\" - the exact routing information this\nwhole page exists to surface, gone, and nobody would notice from the diff\nbecause the sentence still reads fine. The bulk-cancel warning had the same\nproblem in miniature: level 4/5 stopped saying \"nothing is deleted\" while\nstill sounding like a complete warning. All 45 are restored without\nflattening any level back to level-1 phrasing.\n\nAlso: rendersInProgress' Cantonese level 1 (and, it turned out, every other\nlevel once the em-dash grep was run properly) used \"——\" as a parenthetical\naside; rewritten with an ordinary comma, matching how the rest of the\ncatalogue already writes asides in Cantonese (see e.g. settings.ts's \"包括\"\nusage). And settings.github.ghCli.field.host had no call site anywhere in\nthe package - GhCliAccountsList.vue shows the host as an unlabelled chip\nnext to the login, not as a labelled dt/dd fact the way source/protocol/\nscopes are - so the entry was dead from the same commit that introduced it,\nnot a rename casualty. Removed rather than guessing at a mislabelled call\nsite that does not exist.\n\n45 個必須留低嘅事實,靜雞雞喺 rendersInProgress 嗰幾個 funny level 度不見咗 -\n最誇張嗰個係 homeTile 嘅 level 4/5,兩種語言都係,將「呢部機、container,定係\nGitHub 嘅機」同「唔係呢個 session 開始」呢啲關鍵資訊,換咗做一句含含糊糊嘅\n「wherever it is running」。呢頁成立嘅原因就係話畀你知你嘅 render 喺邊度,\n結果個提示自己唔見咗仲要睇落去完全冇問題,係咪幾黑色幽默。今次全部 45 個都\n執返晒,冇一個 level 要拉返做 level 1 嘅口吻。\n\n順手拆埋兩個小炸彈:啲「——」通通換返做逗號,跟返成個 catalogue 一路用嘅寫法;\n仲有 settings.github.ghCli.field.host 呢條 key,原來由第一日開始就冇人用過 -\n個 host 喺 UI 度係一粒冇標籤嘅 chip,唔係跟 source/protocol/scopes 嗰種有\ndt/dd 標籤嘅寫法 - 所以直接剷咗佢,冇亂咁去改個唔存在嘅 call site。",
