                subject: "Voice the backup screen's create-repository and repository-search copy",
                details: "Twenty-three backup.createRepo.* and backup.repo.* keys had inline English\nfallback strings and nothing on the catalogue's side of the call, so every\nlanguage mode and every funny level rendered the same English regardless of\nwhat the user picked. Registered all 23 in packages/ui/src/copy/surfaces/backup.ts\nwith five funny levels in English and Cantonese, FACTS entries pinning what\nmust survive every level, and FIXED entries for the plain UI labels.\n\nTwo things worth a reader's attention: the two visibility notes state the\nreal cost this screen's own call site claims -- PUBLIC means anybody can\ndownload the backup, PRIVATE draws down the repository-count limit of the\nplan it is under -- and deliberately do NOT mention GitHub Actions minutes,\nbecause that trade-off belongs to the CI-render screen (which runs a\nworkflow) and this backup screen never does. repo.none and repo.noMatch stay\ntwo different sentences on purpose: an account with nothing yet is not the\nsame news as a search that found nothing.\n\n23 個 backup.createRepo.* 同 backup.repo.* 嘅 key，之前得個英文 fallback\n吊喺個組件度，catalogue 嗰邊乜都冇，所以唔理你揀邊種語言、揀邊個好笑程度，\n畫面都係嗰句英文，冇變過。而家全部 23 個都registered 埋落\npackages/ui/src/copy/surfaces/backup.ts，英文同廣東話各五個好笑程度，\n仲有 FACTS 釘住邊啲嘢喺邊個程度都唔可以走樣，同埋 FIXED 嘅純介面標籤。\n\n有兩點特別要留意：兩句 visibility 提示講嘅係呢個 call site 真正講嘅代價 --\nPUBLIC 即係任何人都下載得到份備份，PRIVATE 就計落佢所屬方案嘅儲存庫上限度\n-- 特登冇提 GitHub Actions 嘅分鐘數，因為嗰樣嘢係 CI 算圖畫面嘅嘢（嗰度真係\n會跑 workflow），呢個備份畫面從來都唔會跑。repo.none 同 repo.noMatch 特登\n係兩句唔同嘅嘢：個帳戶乜都未有，同你搜尋咩都搵唔到，係兩單完全唔同嘅新聞。",
