                subject: "Give the render mask a drawing surface, so nobody has to already know the coordinates",
                details: "Typing min-x/max-x/center-z/radius by hand was the only way to set a render\nmask, which works great right up until you actually try it and realise you\nhave no idea what block coordinates your own base is at. This adds a real\ncanvas: drag a box/circle/ellipse/polygon on a top-down view, or nudge it\nby the keyboard, and the numbers follow, both ways, live.\n\n- maskCanvas.ts / maskCanvasView.ts: pure geometry, snapping (chunk/region,\n  toggleable), undo/redo, keyboard nudge steps, per-shape area estimate that\n  honestly says \"no number\" instead of reporting 4 billion blocks for an\n  axis BlueMap left unbounded, three presets (whole world, around spawn,\n  extent of measured regions) that each say exactly what they set and never\n  silently swap a circle row for a box, and a small mirror of the\n  cloud/Actions render path's one-box-only limitation so the canvas can\n  show the substitution instead of hiding it.\n- MaskDrawingCanvas.vue: the surface itself, wired into ConfigMaskField.vue\n  behind a per-row \"Draw...\" toggle, with export/import as plain JSON and\n  the existing mask.cost.*/mask.fidelity.* copy (written for this exact\n  canvas by an earlier pass, previously unwired) now actually spoken.\n- maskRecordNormalize.ts: fills a render-mask row's own schema defaults\n  before ConfigMaskField.vue's list-level cost summary hands it to\n  maskGeometry.ts, so a partially-typed shape does not turn into NaN.\n\nKnown overlap for a follow-up: maskDraft.ts/maskFile.ts (a sibling pass)\nbuilt a per-field draft tracker and a dedicated export format with\nsimilar goals to pieces of this; both work today, worth consolidating\nlater rather than rushing it into this change.\n\n而家畫個形狀,唔使死記自己個base响邊度\n\n以前淨係得打字入 min-x/max-x/center-z/radius 先設得到遮罩,聽落幾正常,\n不過你一試就發現：你其實唔知你自己個base响邊粒方塊。而家加咗塊真正嘅\n畫板：喺個俯視圖度拖個 box/circle/ellipse/polygon,或者用鍵盤郁佢,啲數字\n會即刻跟住變,兩邊都得。\n\n- maskCanvas.ts / maskCanvasView.ts：純幾何運算、啜格（chunk/region，可以\n  熄）、復原/重做、鍵盤郁動步數、每個形狀嘅面積估計——冇料到就老實講\n  「冇數畀你」,唔會屈個 40 億方塊出嚟呃你；三個預設（成個世界、圍住重生\n  點、現有 region 嘅範圍）每個都講明自己設咗乜嘢,唔會靜雞雞將個 circle\n  行變咗做 box；仲有個細細嘅雲端／Actions 算圖路線限制鏡像,等塊畫板可以\n  顯示緊「呢個會俾人偷偷換走」,唔係收埋佢。\n- MaskDrawingCanvas.vue：塊畫板本身,喺 ConfigMaskField.vue 度每行加咗個\n  「畫圖…」按鈕開關,可以匯出/匯入做 JSON,同埋之前寫定但未接線嘅\n  mask.cost.*/mask.fidelity.* 文案而家真係講緊嘢。\n- maskRecordNormalize.ts：喺 ConfigMaskField.vue 嘅成個列表面積摘要交畀\n  maskGeometry.ts 之前,補晒個遮罩行自己 schema 嘅預設值,唔畀個未打晒嘅\n  形狀變成 NaN。\n\n留返做後續嘅重疊：maskDraft.ts/maskFile.ts（另一條線做嘅）起咗個逐欄位\n草稿追蹤同專屬匯出格式,同呢度部分嘢目標差唔多；兩邊而家都行得通,遲啲\n先合埋佢哋,唔使而家趕住做。",
                category: "interface",
