                sha: "dca118e4a014bdc18b7d785bb958ea5025354868",
                shortSha: "dca118e4a0",
                date: "2026-08-05T23:26:25-04:00",
                subject: "Bug-hunt fixes: id collisions, chip wrapping, a redundant tooltip",
                details: "Self-review pass over the dimension-selection commit before calling\nit finished. Three real issues, none of them theoretical:\n\n- Two dimensions whose labels slugify to the same id - two custom\n  dimensions with near-identical namespaced names, which is not a\n  contrived case once you allow arbitrary datapacks - would have\n  produced two RenderMapRequests with the same id, the second\n  silently overwriting the first's map config. extraDimensionMaps()\n  now de-duplicates against every id already used in the same\n  request, seeded with the primary map's own id, and the review\n  step's id preview replays the exact same seeding and order so it\n  never disagrees with what actually renders.\n- The sibling-folder fact chip carries a real absolute path, which\n  can be long, and Vuetify's chip content is nowrap by default - at\n  a narrow width or a high display scale that path would have pushed\n  the chip past its row rather than wrapping inside it. It now wraps.\n- The primary dimension's disabled reason lived in both a v-tooltip\n  (undocumented as v-checkbox default-slot content, and reachable\n  only by hovering) and an always-visible sentence right beside it.\n  Only the second was ever load-bearing; the tooltip is gone.\n\n自己起身review多次個dimension-selection commit先算完工,執到三樣真係\n會出事嘅嘢,一樣都唔係度度嚟嘅:\n\n- 兩個維度嘅名一slug化就撞埋一齊嘅id-兩個自訂維度嘅namespace名撞得\n好似,呢個一啲都唔奇怪,datapack愛叫乜就叫乜-舊code會整出兩個一樣id\n嘅RenderMapRequest,second個靜靜雞覆蓋咗第一個嘅地圖設定檔。而家\nextraDimensionMaps()會同呢次request入面用過嘅每一個id對比,由正名地\n圖自己個id做種,覆核步驟嗰個id預覽都跟返同一個種法同次序,永遠唔會同\n真正算出嚟嗰個對唔上。\n- 親戚資料夾嗰個fact chip裝住個真.絕對路徑,可以好長,Vuetify個chip\n內容預設nowrap-窄啲嘅畫面或者高啲嘅display scale就會將個chip撐出行\n之外,而唔係包埋落自己個row入面。而家會包好。\n- 正名維度嗰句disable原因,以前又擺喺v-tooltip(擺喺v-checkbox嘅\ndefault slot度冇文件講過得唔得,而且淨係揸滑鼠hover先睇到),又擺喺\n隔籬一句成日都見到嘅句子。真正頂用嘅淨係第二樣;個tooltip拆咗佢。",
                category: "interface",
                areas: ["interface"],
                files: 4,
