                subject: "Add the Watch it live tab, its copy, and the live-preview docs article",
                details: "The other half of the preview server landed in main/preview/: this wires\nit into the interface as its own tab (App.vue already carried the import\nand the slot from a stale working-tree state another agent's commit swept\nup, so this finishes what that left dangling - components/preview/ and\nthe copy/surfaces/preview.ts catalogue module it depends on).\n\npreviewBridge.ts probes the Electron bridge the way pagesBridge.ts does;\npreviewHost.ts is the framework-light state (12 tests, a fake bridge, no\nmounted component); PreviewScreen.vue is a guided render picker, the\nnetwork-exposure checkbox with its consequence sentence and provenance\nline behind progressive disclosure, and the start/stop/copy/open controls,\nevery one of them catalogued in three language modes at five funny levels\neach with FACTS pinning {url}/{host}/{port} and the real error text. Every\nvoiced and fixed key has a real t() call site in PreviewScreen.vue with\nmatching placeholders - appCopy.test.ts checks that, not just the shape.\n\ndocs/live-preview.md explains the whole feature; docs/README.md and\ndocsModel.ts's RENDERING_ORDER both name it, which docsIndexCoverage.test.ts\nnow checks agree.\n\n即係將main/preview/嗰個server嘅另一半,擺埋落個介面度,開返個「即時\n直播睇」分頁俾人揸(App.vue入面嗰句import同嗰個slot,原來已經俾第二\n個agent嘅commit手快快執埋咗,執嗰陣個working tree啱啱好有呢兩句 -\n今次補返嗰半:components/preview/ 同佢靠嘅嗰個copy/surfaces/preview.ts\ncatalogue module)。\n\npreviewBridge.ts學返pagesBridge.ts嗰套去試探Electron bridge;\npreviewHost.ts淨係狀態,唔沾框架(12個測試,用個fake bridge,唔使掛\n真嘅component);PreviewScreen.vue有得揀render、有網絡開放嘅checkbox\n連埋後果句同出處句收埋喺progressive disclosure、仲有開始/停止/複製/\n開瀏覽器嘅掣,全部三種語言模式、五級笑位都寫齊,FACTS釘死咗\n{url}/{host}/{port}同真正錯誤字句。每一個voiced同fixed key,\nPreviewScreen.vue入面都有真係嗌到嘅t()位,placeholder啱啱好對得上 -\nappCopy.test.ts驗嘅係呢樣,唔淨係驗個形狀啱唔啱。\n\ndocs/live-preview.md講晒成個功能;docs/README.md同docsModel.ts嘅\nRENDERING_ORDER都記低咗佢,而家docsIndexCoverage.test.ts會驗兩邊啱唔啱。",
