                subject: "Stop declaring Translate and T twice in one file",
                details: "The repository-creation work added its own copy of the two vue-i18n helper\ntypes beside the section that used them, while identical declarations were\nalready sitting 140 lines above. TypeScript counts a duplicate type name as an\nerror, so the whole ui package failed its typecheck on two names that were\nnever wrong, only written twice.\n\nDeleted the second pair and left a note saying where the first pair lives, so\nthe next person adding a section to this file reaches for them instead of\nretyping them a third time.\n\n同一個檔案入面,同一對 type 寫足兩次,TypeScript 就話你重複定義,成個 package\n嘅 typecheck 即刻炸——明明兩份一模一樣,冇一份係錯,錯在寫多咗一次。刪走下面\n嗰對,留低一句話喺度話你知上面已經有,唔使第三次再打過。",
