                subject: "Detect every dimension a world folder really has",
                details: "inspect.ts already knew region/DIM-1/DIM1 and dimensions/<ns>/<path>,\nbut two real layouts fell through the cracks: a Spigot/Paper server\nsplitting the nether and end into sibling world_nether/world_the_end\nfolders (upstream's own MCAWorld.resolveDimensionFolder resolves a\ndimension against whichever folder a running server hands it, but\nnothing here had a server to ask, so it now looks for the two\nconventional sibling names beside the chosen folder - by exact name,\nthen case-insensitively from one bounded parent listing, and only\nonce level.dat plus real region data both confirm it); and a world\nwhose vanilla dimensions live under the *modern*\ndimensions/minecraft/<name>/region path rather than the legacy one,\nwhich real worlds found on this machine during verification actually\ndo - previously mislabelled as unrecognised custom dimensions and\nrendered with the Overworld's own sky colour, void colour and\nambient light baked in regardless of which dimension they really\nwere. Both are read-only: two lstat calls confirm a sibling, nothing\nis ever written, and no region file is opened to count it.\n\n23 new inspect.ts tests build real Spigot/Paper-shaped fixture trees\nunder a temp directory, including one proving nothing on disk\nchanges across a full inspection. worldFolder.ts's dimensionsIn\ngained an `external`/`worldFolder` pair so a split dimension's map\npoints BlueMap at the folder that actually has its data, and a guard\nso a vanilla dimension found under its modern path is never also\nlisted a second time as an unrecognised custom one.\n\ninspect.ts本來識region/DIM-1/DIM1同dimensions/<ns>/<path>，但漏咗兩種\n真實存在嘅排法：Spigot/Paper伺服器成日將地獄同終界劈開做兩個親戚資料\n夾world_nether同world_the_end（上游自己嗰個\nMCAWorld.resolveDimensionFolder係靠緊running緊嘅伺服器話畀佢知去邊，\n但呢度冇伺服器可以問，所以而家會喺揀嘅資料夾隔籬搵返呢兩個慣例叫法-\n先試準確個名，唔啱先case-insensitive咁掃一次親戚資料夾，仲要親眼見到\nlevel.dat同真係有region資料先算數）；仲有一種就係個世界啲原版維度住喺\n新式嘅dimensions/minecraft/<name>/region度而唔係舊式路徑-呢部機搵到嘅\n真實世界真係咁做緊，以前會被錯認做「唔識嘅自訂維度」，然後不分青紅皂\n白全部用返Overworld嘅天空顏色、虛空顏色同環境光去畫，唔理你其實係邊\n個維度。兩樣嘢都係淨係讀嘢：確認一個親戚資料夾淨係使兩次lstat，乜嘢\n都唔會寫落去，一個region檔案都唔使開嚟數。\n\n23個inspect.ts新測試喺臨時目錄度砌返個真.Spigot/Paper款嘅fixture樹，\n其中一個仲證明成次inspection行完，磁碟上乜都冇變過。worldFolder.ts嘅\ndimensionsIn多咗external/worldFolder呢對嘢，等劈開咗嘅維度張地圖識指\n返去真正有資料嗰個資料夾；仲加咗個guard，保證一個用新式路徑搵到嘅原\n版維度唔會又再被當多次做唔識嘅自訂維度。",
