                subject: "Add a Renders in progress page: every render, every route, never lost to a tab change",
                details: "The reported bug read as data loss and turned out to be eyesight loss. Renders\nalready live entirely in the main process - RenderOrchestrator's own Map,\nuntouched by which window is looking - and a container survives the whole app\nclosing because Docker's daemon owns it, not the client. WorldScreen.vue's\nunmount only unsubscribed from events; it never cancelled anything. What\nactually vanished on navigating away was the view: createRenderRun()'s state\nlived in refs private to whichever component built them, so a render carried\non in the dark with nobody left to watch it report in.\n\nThis adds the missing lightbulb: a page that lists every render on all three\nroutes (local process, Docker container, GitHub's runners) by reconciling\nworldBridge.activeRenders()/renderEngine(), the container-reattach machinery\nthat was built and wired but reachable only from inside the Make-a-map tab,\nand the existing CI-render composable - reused rather than re-polled. A tab\nlabel carries a live count for the life of the shell, Home offers the same\ndoor, and Open console lands one click deep via a new focusRenderId prop on\nWorldScreen. Search is the shared regex builder; bulk-cancel sits behind the\nsuper-confirmation slider; a single-row Stop does not, matching the console's\nown convention that a stopped render's tiles are never at risk. New tests:\n16 for the page and its aggregator, including the regression test itself -\na fresh instance discovering a render it never watched start, with progress\nthat keeps arriving. App.test.ts's own tab-count assertion is updated to ten.\n\n執行緊嘅 render 一直冇死過，死嘅只係嗰扇望得入去嘅窗。call 早已經喺 main\nprocess 度自己搏命跑緊，你唔望佢佢都照跑，container 仲要成個 app 收埋咗都\n繼續喺 Docker 度篤篤篤；離開嗰版只不過係唔再聽個 event，從來冇話拎起電話\n叫佢收工。而家整多一版，三條路（本機、container、GitHub 嘅機）嘅 render\n一次過睇晒，仲有個常駐嘅計數喺分頁度，唔理你揭去邊版都睇得返轉頭。撳\n「打開控制台」一撳直入，批量停止要拉盡個滑塊先做得，因為呢個係会摧毀緊做\n緊嘅嘢（但已經畫低嘅 tile 永遠唔會冇咗）。新增 16 個測試，包括嗰個真.\nregression test：一個從未見過個 render 開波嘅新實例，一樣揾到佢，仲追得\n到佢之後嘅進度。",
