                details: "The import landed in an earlier commit but the three spread lines\nthat actually pull GHCLIACCOUNTS_VOICED/_FIXED/_FACTS into\nSURFACE_VOICED/_FIXED/_FACTS were lost to a concurrent edit on this\nshared file before that commit landed, so every t() call in\nGhCliAccountsList.vue was silently falling back to English no matter\nwhat language or funny level was selected. catalogueCoverage.test.ts\ncaught it immediately once run. Re-added and verified: all 26 keys\nthe component actually calls now resolve through appCopyKeys().\n\n拃咗嘅三行終於補返：之前嗰個 commit 得個 import 落咗地，實際攞嗰三個\n物件混入大目錄嘅三行喺落定之前俾人喺呢個共用檔案度手多多拂咗，搞到\n成個 GhCliAccountsList.vue 淨係識講英文，唔理你揀邊種語言定係幾好笑。\n而家補返晒，26 個 key 全部搵得返。",
