                subject: "Let the app prepare an empty or unprepared repository for CI rendering",
                details: "Previously the CI-render screen's route probe read only render-world.yml\non the target repository; a repository that never had the workflow\ncommitted 404s exactly like one the signed-in account cannot see, so a\nfreshly created empty repository - the ordinary way to start - hit a\npermanently disabled render button with a message that read like a\npermissions problem. This wires the repository-bootstrap operation\n(bootstrap.ts) into the app: an IPC channel, a bridge, and a \"Set this\nrepository up\" button that runs it live with real progress, a real\nper-file outcome, an honest Actions-enabled answer, and a re-auth\nbutton for the one scope gap that actually needs it. A successful run\nre-checks the repository so the next screen is \"start a render,\" not\nthe form you just filled in again. Also ships the two workflow files as\nreal installer resources (electron-builder.config.cjs), because a\npackaged build has no .github/workflows of its own to fall back to and\nwould have refused every bootstrap with a mysterious \"could not be\nfound\" the moment somebody actually installed it.\n\n以前嘅 CI 算圖畫面淨係識問 render-world.yml 喺唔喺度，一個啱啱整好、乜都\n未有嘅倉庫同一個你根本冇權睇嘅私人倉庫，佢答你嘅方式係一模一樣 —— 都係\n話「冇路可通」，撳極個掣都係死㗎。而家加咗一個「幫呢個倉庫設定好」掣，\n真係識自己加返個 workflow 檔、話你知加咗啲乜、Actions 開咗未，仲有漏咗\n\"workflow\" 呢個權限嘅話會叫你再登入一次。設定完仲會自動再check多次，等\n你直接去到下一步：開始算圖，唔使自己再撳多次。仲補埋打包安裝程式漏咗嘅\nworkflow 檔案 —— 唔係喺呢度執嘅話，正式裝落機嘅版本會搵唔到嗰兩個檔案，\n「幫你設定好」呢個掣就會不明不白咁死畀你睇。",
                category: "shell",
