                subject: "Recognise and adopt a repository this app already prepared for CI rendering",
                details: "Moving to a second computer used to mean a bare GitHub repository list and\na re-answered wizard, with nothing telling you which repository was the\nreal one. worldrepo/adopt.ts now checks a repository for either marker\nthis app writes - repo.ts's own world-repo marker (the branch that carries\na synced world and its project file) and cirender/bootstrap.ts's CI-setup\nmarker (the one that just proves a render workflow was installed) - and\nreports a hedged \"looks like yours\" rather than a certainty for either one.\nWhere a project file is actually reachable, buildAdoptionPlan reads back\nthe maps, storages and render options it would restore, and just as\nimportantly names what it deliberately will not: the world folder path,\nlocal Java/Docker/dependency state and any remote-host SSH configuration,\nnone of which ever leaves the old computer. A CI-bootstrap-only repository\nis recognised honestly as having nothing to restore rather than silently\nskipped. A marker from a newer app version, and a project format from a\nnewer app version, both degrade to a plain sentence instead of a guess. An\nexisting local sync of the same repository is detected so adoption never\nproposes a second, duplicate binding. Every call this makes is a GET; nothing\nhere writes to the repository. New IPC channels worldrepo:adoptionProbe and\nworldrepo:adoptionPlan expose it, and a dedicated test audits the marker's\nown bytes for anything that should never sit in a public repository - an\nabsolute path, a username, a host, a credential - by running a real sync\nagainst a temp folder under this OS's own profile-shaped path and reading\nthe marker back off disk.\n\n搬去第二部電腦，以前只有一個裸嘅倉庫清單，同一份要重新答一次嘅精靈，冇嘢話你知邊個先係嗰個真身。而家 adopt.ts 識揸兩種呢個\napp 自己寫嘅 marker——world-repo 個（記住個 branch 帶住 synced world 同 project file）同 bootstrap 個\n（淨係證明個 render workflow 裝咗）——見到就話「睇落似係你」，唔會話「實係」。搵到 project file 嘅話，\nbuildAdoptionPlan 會讀返幅圖、啲 storage、render 設定會還原返，仲會老實講邊啲唔會還原：world\nfolder 路徑、本機 Java/Docker 狀態、遠端 SSH 設定，呢啲永遠唔會離開舊電腦。淨係 bootstrap 過但未 sync\n過 world 嘅倉庫，會老實話冇嘢可以還原，唔會靜雞雞跳過。marker 或 project 格式如果係新版 app\n寫嘅，會用一句說話講清楚，唔會靠估。已經喺呢部機 sync 咗嘅倉庫會被認出嚟，唔會整多一份重複綁定。呢度做嘅全部都係\nGET，一個字都冇寫入個倉庫。新增 IPC channel worldrepo:adoptionProbe 同 worldrepo:adoptionPlan\n攞嚟用；仲有條測試專門查 marker 本身啲 bytes 有冇唔應該出現喺公開倉庫嘅嘢——絕對路徑、用戶名、host、密碼——真係\nsync 一次去個喺呢部電腦 profile 路徑下嘅臨時 folder，再讀返寫落disk嘅marker嚟驗。",
