                subject: "Discover Bedrock and CurseForge worlds, and multi-instance launcher roots",
                details: "Extends the main-process Minecraft folder catalogue (packages/app/src/main/world/)\nwith three real, verified locations beyond vanilla %APPDATA%\\.minecraft\\saves:\n\n- Bedrock Edition's worlds folder, at the packaged-app storage path Windows gives\n  every Store app (%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Packages\\Microsoft.MinecraftUWP_8wekyb3d8bbwe\\\n  LocalState\\games\\com.mojang\\minecraftWorlds). The general Packages/<name>/LocalState\n  shape was confirmed present and populated on a real development machine; the\n  Minecraft UWP package itself was not, because Bedrock is not installed there, so the\n  row behaves like the existing \"beside-executable\" default and stays silent rather\n  than showing a permanent \"missing\" line to everyone who lacks it.\n- CurseForge's own instance root, confirmed for real on that same machine at\n  <home>\\curseforge\\minecraft\\Instances\\<Instance Name>\\saves, each instance carrying\n  its own minecraftinstance.json beside its saves folder.\n- A generic \"launcher root\" shape (new launcherRoots.ts): an Instances directory whose\n  children each hold their own saves, detected by shape rather than by launcher name,\n  so a folder from an unverified launcher sharing the same convention still resolves,\n  and every launcher this repository could not verify (MultiMC, Prism, ATLauncher,\n  GDLauncher, Modrinth) still gets no invented default path.\n\nmountMinecraftFolder now recognises a launcher root handed over by a person too - not\nonly the CurseForge default - and mounts every instance found under it as its own\nfolder in one action, picking up only newly appeared instances on a later remount.\nlistMinecraftFolders expands the CurseForge default fresh on every read, so a new\nmodpack instance appears with nothing remounted.\n\n116 tests green in design/packages/app/src/main/world (58 new), tsc and eslint clean.\n\n如果話 Bedrock 世界會匿埋喺 UWP 嘅打包資料夾入面,呢個 commit 就係去踢爆佢:一路以嚟得\n一個 .minecraft/saves 執到入面,而家連 CurseForge 個 Instances 大雜燴、同埋 Bedrock\n收埋喺 Packages 深宫入面嘅存檔都揾得返。冇亂噏第二個 launcher 個路徑,淨係認得個\n「Instances 入面一堆 saves」嘅形狀 —— 冇驗過嘅嘢就照冇,唔會靠估嚟呃你。",
