                subject: "Add gh CLI account listing/switching and credential-routing fallback",
                details: "The app already had its own multi-account GitHub sign-in; this adds a\nsecond, deliberately separate surface for the accounts the `gh`\ncommand-line tool itself is signed in as, plus the logic to fall back\nto `gh` when the app's own sign-in fails for a credential reason.\n\n- main/ghcli/accounts.ts: lists gh's accounts via the stable\n  `gh auth status --json hosts` route (confirmed present on gh\n  2.96.0), falling back to parsing plain text only when the JSON\n  route is unavailable, and never reporting zero accounts for an\n  unrecognised answer. Switching (`gh auth switch`) always re-reads\n  the account list afterwards rather than trusting the exit code, and\n  its result names the machine-wide consequence explicitly.\n- main/ghcli/routing.ts: classifies a GitHub failure as worth retrying\n  through the other credential (401/403/404/missing-scope) or not\n  (network, rate limit, malformed request), picks an account by scope\n  before failing, and refuses to run a WRITE through a different\n  account than the one selected without asking first. A 404-then-\n  success is reported as an access difference, never as \"found it\n  after all\"; a 404-then-404 is reported as genuinely missing.\n- main/ghcli/ipc.ts wires two new channels (`ghCli:listAccounts`,\n  `ghCli:switchAccount`); preload and main/index.ts expose them\n  alongside, never instead of, the existing `github:*` channels.\n- A new copy surface (ghCliAccounts.ts) carries the two-stores\n  distinction and the machine-wide switch warning through all five\n  funny levels and both languages, with FACTS pinning the warning so\n  it can never be softened away.\n\nRenderer bridge/store land in this commit too (ghCliBridge.ts,\nghCliAccountsStore.ts); the list component and settings wiring follow\nin the next commit.\n\n54 + 12 new tests pass (main/ghcli, ui copy catalogue).\n\n我哋部程式一直都有自己嗰套登入，而家加多樣嘢：睇下 gh 呢個command-line\n工具自己登入緊邊個帳戶，同埋喺程式自己個登入唔掂嘅時候，識得轉去用\ngh 嗰個。兩本數簿分得好清楚，唔會撈埋一齊當一本嚟睇；轉帳戶呢件事會\n搞到成部電腦，所以每次都會老老實實講埋俾你知。",
