                details: "A project used to be protected by history only at the moment somebody\nremembered to press Save. Now `project/autosave.ts` schedules the exact\nsame write-then-record call on a quiet debounce, forces a write once a\ncontinuous editing session hits a ceiling, flushes immediately at a\nboundary or before anything destructive, and flushes every pending world\nbefore the application is allowed to quit. An unchanged project schedules\nnothing, a burst of edits coalesces into one write, and an autosave that\nfails - caller-injected rejection or a plain broken-history result - never\ntakes the scheduler down or blocks the next one. `project:autosaveNotify`\nand `project:autosaveFlush` put this on the IPC channel next to the manual\nsave/history/restore handlers it shares `saveProject` with, and\n`wireAutosaveQuitFlush` hooks it into `will-quit` through a minimal\nElectron-shaped interface so the scheduler itself needs no Electron\nruntime to test. Also carries the project-history retention endpoint\n(`project:discardOlder`, `discardOlderProjectRevisions`,\n`projectHistoryProjects`) a teammate landed alongside it in the same\nfiles, so the build stays whole rather than referencing an export that\ndoes not exist yet.\n\n以前得手動撳一下 Save,個世界先至有歷史保護,唔撳就乜都無。而家\n`project/autosave.ts` 用防手震嘅靜止計時器,自動叫返同一套「寫先、\n記錄後」嘅老 API,打字打到停唔到手仲有個上限逼佢寫,關鍵時刻(要\n做破壞性嘢之前、程式準備退出)即刻沖水,乜都無變就乜都唔記,一輪\n爆炸式編輯埋單埋做一次寫入,寫壞咗都唔會累街坊拖冧成個排程。仲一\n拼帶埋隊友喺同一啲檔案加嘅專案歷史保留/清舊功能,等個 build 唔會\n斷氣話搵唔到個 export。",
