                details: "openAppearanceEditor's AnchoredPanel sets dismissBoundary: null because its\nanchor is the (possibly huge) element being edited, not a toggle control.\nThat alone meant a pointerdown inside colorRow()'s colour-swatch picker or\nfontRow()'s font-family list -- both a SECOND, independent AnchoredPanel\nwhose element is appended straight to document.body, never nested inside\nthe editor panel's own element -- was read as \"outside the editor\" by the\neditor's own listener (registered first, so it runs first), closing the\nwhole editor and clearing its content out from under the still-open\npicker: the one interaction the editor exists for. AnchoredPanel already\ngained a general fix for this shape of bug (a module-level open-panel\nregistry an outside-click check walks before closing, so a popover opened\nfrom a control living inside a panel's own content is recognised rather\nthan treated as outside) while this session's work was in flight; this\ncommit adds the appearance-editor-specific regression tests that prove it,\ndriven through the real colorRow()/fontRow() wiring pattern rather than a\nsynthetic stand-in. Watched both new assertions fail red against the\npre-registry version of anchoredPanel.ts (dismissBoundary alone, no\nopen-panel tracking) before confirming green against the fixed one.\n\nAlso discovered, and flagged separately rather than fixed here since it is\nunrelated: createColorPicker() in appearance/color/picker.ts recurses\nforever the instant it renders (its render() dispatches a synthetic\n\"input\" event on its sliders, which re-triggers the very listeners that\ncall back into render()), so this file's colour-picker coverage exercises\ncolorRow()'s own AnchoredPanel wiring directly rather than the real picker.\n\n編輯外觀嗰塊面板嘅「錨」聽晒個成頁噉大嘅目標,梗係要話明邊啲撳擊唔算「界\n外」,唔通就乜撳擊都話喺自己隻手臂入面?但呢招有個罅隙:入面嗰粒色掣、\n字體掣自己開嘅細波仔,係開喺 document.body 度嘅獨立面板,唔係編輯面板嘅\n親生仔,一撳落去就即刻話「界外閂門」,連個色掣都仲未撳完。呢個罅隙而家\n喺 anchoredPanel.ts 度用個「開緊面板名冊」整咗,呢個 commit 加返啲測試,\n證明編輯外觀呢頭一樣受惠——未整之前睇住佢炸紅,整完先收貨。\n\n執手尾仲執到一單完全冇關嘅炸彈:個色掣揀色器一開即刻自己同自己打交,\nrender() 撳自己啲滑桿嘅 \"input\" 事件,啲滑桿嘅監聽器又翻轉頭撳返 render()\n——冇完冇了,叠到爆晒個 call stack。呢單同今次嘅罅隙冇關係,已經開緊\n第二單工作處理。",
