                details: "A concurrent commit on this shared checkout (75f85db) landed\nAppearanceTarget.vue's import of claimAppearancePopup/releaseAppearancePopup\nfrom useAppearance.js without the module actually exporting them yet -- an\nartifact of two agents editing the same working tree at once, not a\ndeliberate scope change here. Left as-is, HEAD would ship a component\nimporting two names its own module never defines. This commit is the other\nhalf: the two functions themselves, coordinating which AppearanceTarget\ninstance owns the single open menu/editor slot so a second right-click\nelsewhere closes the first instance's popup before opening its own.\n\nHong Kong Cantonese: 隔籬個commit淨係帶咗個掛鈎返嚟,冇帶埋條鏈,搞到成個\ncomponent企喺度import緊兩個根本未存在嘅嘢。而家補返呢兩個function落\nuseAppearance.ts,等邊個AppearanceTarget揸緊個彈出視窗,一目了然,唔會兩個\n選單同時開喺度打交。",
