                details: "v-bind=\"{ activator: root, target: pos }\" resolves activator/target\ncomponent props exactly like :activator=\"root\" :target=\"pos\" does at\nruntime, but hasDynamicActivator()/hasExplicitTarget() only matched the\nliteral quoted-attribute syntax, so this idiom (already used elsewhere\nin the package, e.g. ProfileManager.vue/ProjectList.vue/App.vue) could\nreintroduce the \"menu does not close on outside click\" bug invisibly.\nBoth detectors now also look inside an object-literal v-bind for the\nsame two keys, with a regression test proving the miss and the catch.\n\nVuetify 個 v-bind object-spread 一直係度扮嘢扮到隱形人咁,躲喺\n:activator=\"...\"/:target=\"...\" 嘅正則後面,冇人見到佢都做緊同一單嘢 --\nresult 一樣會整返個右鍵選單癲咗唔識自己收工。而家個守衛終於識埋呢招,\n擺埋一個 regression test 落去,證明未修之前捉唔到,修完就即刻捉正實。",
