                details: "The store, the IPC channel and the live-reading downloader all shipped in\nthe previous three commits; this is the missing surface. Adds the preload\nbridge, a settingsBridge.ts contract mirroring the render-memory one,\ncreateDownloadConcurrencySetting (a bounded number rather than an\nautomatic/manual toggle - there is no machine-derived recommendation for\nthis one), a DownloadConcurrencyRow next to RenderMemoryRow, a new\ndownload-concurrency settings section (search-indexed, not render-\nreachable, for the same reason notification duration is not), bilingual\nfive-level copy with the shipped default of four pinned as a FACT in both\nlanguages, and the version-history mirror through recordAppSetting the\nother settings use. Full workspace typecheck and lint are clean; the\nwhole app and ui test suites pass except two pre-existing, unrelated\nfailures from other in-flight work (downloads.link catalogue gap,\nRemoteFileBrowser path-field policy) that are being flagged separately.\n\n个 store、IPC channel 同识读新鲜设定嘅 downloader 之前三个 commit 都上咗船，\n净返呢个画面控制未整。跟 render-memory 嗰套一样嘅骨架，加咗\npreload bridge、settingsBridge 契约、一个纯数字设定（冇 automatic 呢回事，\n因为冇部机自己嘅数据可以计出边个数字啱），一个新嘅 settings 分区，\n双语五级文案，仲有个预设值「四」用 FACTS 钉死喺两种语言度。\n成个 workspace typecheck 同 lint 都干净，app 同 ui 测试全部过，\n净係有两条同我呢次工作完全冇关嘅旧失败测试，会另外开单。",
