                subject: "Put a Scheduled re-rendering panel on the CI-render screen",
                details: "The last hop: an accordion under each row - closed by default, one\nopen at a time - with the on/off switch, the four-cadence select\n(never a cron field), and the workflow's own last check read back\nverbatim: when, what it decided, why, when the next one is due, and\nwhen a render last actually started. Absent entirely on a build\nwithout both bridge methods, same degradation as every other optional\npart of this screen. Fixes a real bug found while wiring it up:\nsaveSchedule was swallowing a write refusal - \"this world has never\nbeen uploaded\" - because the outer channel succeeded even though the\nwrite itself said no; scheduleFailure is now set for that case too,\nso the alert actually shows instead of silently doing nothing.\n\nFifteen copy keys: nine short factual FIXED labels, and five VOICED\nsentences (the section's own cost explanation, and one for each of\nchanged/unchanged/unknown/error) each carrying a pinned fact through\nall five funny levels in both languages, checked by the catalogue's\nown tests. VSwitch was the one Vuetify component this screen had never\nneeded before, and this file imports every component it uses by name\nrather than trusting global registration - the switch silently failing\nto resolve, with no compile error, is the reason that convention\nexists.\n\n最後一截:每一行低下加一個accordion——預設閂埋,一次淨係開一個——入面\n有開關掣、嗰四個頻率嘅select(絕對唔係一個cron欄),同埋workflow自己\n上次check嘅結果原原本本讀返出嚟:幾時check、check到乜、點解、下次幾\n時、上次真正開始render係幾時。Build 冇齊兩個bridge method就成個部分\n唔會出現,同呢個畫面其他選擘性嘅部分一樣退化法。駁緊條線嗰陣執到一個\n真bug:saveSchedule 之前會靜靜雞吞咗一個寫入拒絕——「呢個世界從未上\n載過」——因為外層channel成功咗,即管寫入嗰個動作本身講唔得。而家呢種\n情況都會set返scheduleFailure,個alert先至真係彈得出嚟,唔會乜都唔做。\n\n十五條copy key:九條短短嘅factual FIXED標籤,五句VOICED句子(嗰段成本\n解釋,加埋changed/unchanged/unknown/error各一句),每句喺兩種語言、五\n個funny level入面都釘實住一個fact,靠catalogue自己嘅test查住。VSwitch\n係呢個畫面第一次要用嘅Vuetify元件——呢個file入面每一個用到嘅元件都係\n點名import,唔係靠global registration,而個switch靜靜雞resolve唔到、\n連個compile error都冇彈,就係呢條規矩存在嘅原因。",
