                subject: "Fix CI lint: use the schedule fake's owner/repo, drop a leftover probe test",
                details: "ciRenders.test.ts defined owner/repo on the ciRenderScheduleRead fake and\nthen let them sit there unused - the linter was right to notice, and the\nbetter fix wasn't to rename them into invisibility with an underscore. The\ntest already asks loadSchedule(\"o\", \"r\") for a reason, so the fake now\nrecords what it was actually called with and asserts it, the same\n\"forwards its arguments\" pattern the loadOwners tests next to it already\nuse for accountId. Coverage went up instead of a variable going quiet.\n\n__reviewer_probe.test.ts was scratch material that slipped in through a\nbulk auto-commit: the filename says \"probe\", the describe block is\nliterally titled \"REVIEWER PROBE\", and it carries a debug console.log\nwith an inline \"THE CLAIM: ...\" comment - the tell-tale signs of a\none-off investigation, not intended coverage. Its exact scenario\n(removeAccount racing a concurrent setActiveAccount) is already covered,\nmore thoroughly, by accounts.test.ts's \"does not let a concurrent\nremoveAccount() clobber a setActiveAccount() that lands while it awaits\",\nwhich is why its own eslint-disable had gone stale: nothing in it was\ntriggering the rule it was disabling anymore. Deleted rather than kept.\n\nciRenders.test.ts 入面本來幫 owner/repo 起咗名，然之後就晾喺嗰度冇人用 -\n撞linter都啱嘅，最好嘅修法唔係加條底線扮冇嘢。個test本身就係\nloadSchedule(\"o\", \"r\") 咁樣嗌，所以而家個fake老實記低自己收到乜嘢先斷言，\n同隔籬 loadOwners test 度驗 accountId 嗰招一樣。變量冇再靜靜哋消失，\n反而test仲驗多咗嘢。\n\n__reviewer_probe.test.ts 係一次過大批auto commit 唔小心手多手快帶埋入嚟嘅\n草稿：檔名寫住「probe」，describe直頭叫「REVIEWER PROBE」，重有段debug用嘅\nconsole.log同\"THE CLAIM: ...\"註解 - 一睇就知係一次過查嘢嘅野稿，唔係認真\n留低嘅test。佢查嗰個情況（removeAccount同setActiveAccount同時撞埋）\naccounts.test.ts 早有更全面嘅test罩住，就係嗰個eslint-disable都已經過期\n嘅原因 - 冇嘢再撞得着個規則喇。所以直接刪咗佢，冇留低。",
