                details: "A changed heap ceiling was a real, persisted setting with nowhere for\nanyone to see that it had changed: render-memory.json has no history\nfamily of its own the way profiles and the app-settings bag do, so a\nsave now also mirrors into the shared settings history under the key\nrenderMemory, the same fire-and-forget pattern every other bag entry\nalready follows. A refused or missing history channel still leaves\nthe real setting saved; only the memory of having changed it was ever\nat risk.\n\n改咗個 heap 上限係真金白銀有記落嘅設定，可惜以前冇地方畀人睇返曾經改過。\nrender-memory.json 唔似設定檔清單同 app 設定袋咁有自己嘅版本記錄家族，所以而家\n儲存嗰陣會鏡射一份入去共用嘅設定記錄，用 renderMemory 呢個 key，同袋入面第二啲\nkey 一樣做法：射咗就算，唔理有冇人接。就算個記錄通道壞咗或者唔存在，真正嗰個\n設定一樣儲得妥當；有風險嘅只不過係「曾經改過」呢段記憶。",
