                details: "Every informational and success notification used one fixed timing\nfor every reader everywhere: 5 seconds, 4 seconds, no exceptions, no\nmatter how fast or slow anyone actually reads. A new Notification\nduration dial in Settings gives that decision back, the same shape\nthe Speed dial already uses for render threads: five friendly levels,\nlevel 3 pinned to the exact numbers this app always shipped with, and\na top level that turns a toast into a warning in every way that\nmatters - it stays until you dismiss it. Warnings and errors were\nnever touched by the old timers and are not touched by the new dial\neither, at any level; that is the one thing forty new tests keep\nchecking for.\n\n以前資訊同成功嘅通知淨係得一個死板嘅顯示時間：5秒、4秒，冇得傾，唔理你睇嘢快\n唔快。而家設定入面有個新嘅「通知留幾耐」轉盤，同 Speed 轉盤揀算圖執行緒嗰個做\n法一樣：五個貼心嘅等級，第 3 級精準對返呢個 app 一直用開嘅數字，最高嗰級令個\n提示變到同警告一樣企定定唔郁，一定要你自己收埋先走。警告同錯誤由頭到尾都冇畀\n舊嘅計時器郁過，新嘅轉盤一樣唔敢郁佢哋，邊個等級都係咁——呢一點正正係四十個\n新測試日日夜夜盯實嘅嘢。",
