                subject: "Add an SSH file browser with world-folder recognition, Explorer-style",
                details: "main/remote/browse.ts lists a remote directory over the same ssh this\napp already trusts, detecting a Linux or Windows remote and reading\nthe \"does this look like a Minecraft world\" signal (level.dat plus a\nregion folder) in the same round trip as the listing, never claiming\na world from half the evidence. The Windows path never depends on\nguessing the login shell: it hands ssh five completely unquoted words\nending in a base64 -EncodedCommand blob, which survives cmd.exe,\nPowerShell or sh equally, sidestepping the POSIX-only quoting the rest\nof this package correctly relies on everywhere else.\n\nremote:browse wires it onto IPC; remoteBridge.ts, remoteBrowse.ts and\nRemoteFileBrowser.vue bring it into the interface as a real Explorer:\na clickable breadcrumb, Up, Back (Backspace/Alt+Left, never while\ntyping), double-click and Enter to enter a folder, sortable columns,\ntype-ahead, and a path field kept in sync with the breadcrumb in both\ndirections. A folder is badged \"Minecraft world\" only with both\nsignals present; one signal alone gets an honestly-worded \"possibly\"\nbadge and says which half is missing, in the copy catalogue's full\nfive-level bilingual voice - a guess dressed up as certainty helps\nnobody find their world. A folder of thousands of entries stays\nresponsive by paging: the backend caps a listing at 2,048 entries and\nsays so, rather than rendering an unbounded table.\n\nWired into RemoteTargetEditor's work-directory field, which used to\ndeliberately grow no browse button because there was no way to look at\nthe remote filesystem - RemoteTargetEditor.test.ts's own test for that\nabsence is updated to prove the new button is genuinely SSH-backed and\nnever touches the local file dialog PathField.vue uses next to it.\n\n一個學足 Windows Explorer 嘅 SSH 檔案瀏覽器,兼識得嗅邊個資料夾似\nMinecraft 世界。之前想搵個 work directory,淨係得個得意小巧嘅文字框,\n自己打路徑,打錯字都唔知——而家可以真係喺個 list 度行入去揀。斷估\n嗰邊仲叻:淨係見到 level.dat 唔會屈落去話係世界,淨係見到 region\n資料夾都唔會,兩樣要齊晒先至肯講「似係」,仲要老實講返缺咗邊樣。\nWindows 嗰隻遠端最陰質嘅一招,係全程唔使估佢用緊邊個 shell:五舊字\n一路唔使加引號咁送去,base64 包住嘅 -EncodedCommand,cmd.exe、\nPowerShell、定係 sh,邊個都食得落。",
