                details: "The marker panel's regex builder shared bare regexBuilder.* keys with the menu builder's catalogue entries under different English wording, so whichever text landed in the catalogue was quietly overwriting the other builder's translation the moment either got voiced. Rename the marker builder to its own markerRegex.* namespace and voice all 64 keys (nine of them full five-level VOICED entries, the rest FIXED labels), extending appCopy.test.ts's call-site scanner to also recognize markers' tx()/tp() wrappers so the orphan-detection guard can actually see them. Also voice projectModel.ts's five project.row.* keys, closing components/project's translation gap down to two structurally untranslatable keyboard-key labels. Finally, re-verify all five \"specified\" product contracts against their real guard tests and correct every stale statusNote and companion article that still described gaps now closed (super-confirmation's two GitHub call sites, tab navigation's desktop appearance editors, appearance-editors' \"four things\" undercount, localization's \"roughly a hundred keys\") -- while leaving contract status itself at \"specified\" everywhere, per content.test.ts's own standing rule that these five pages never claim \"shipped\".\n\n個 marker 面板嘅 regex builder 同個 menu builder 撞晒 key，兩個都用光脫脫嘅 regexBuilder.* 嚟做 catalogue key，但英文字完全唔同 -- 邊個先加落 catalogue，另一個就靜雞雞畀人偷咗把聲。而家幫 marker builder 起埋自己個 markerRegex.* namespace，64 個 key 全部配好聲（九個五級 VOICED，其餘做 FIXED），仲要教 appCopy.test.ts 個掃描器識認 markers 用嘅 tx()/tp() wrapper，唔係嗰個防止「有聲冇人聽」嘅守衛見唔到佢哋。順便幫 projectModel.ts 五個 project.row.* key 配埋聲，components/project 個翻譯窿即刻縮到剩返兩個結構上譯唔到嘅鍵盤鍵名。最後，逐個對住真正嘅 guard test 覆核晒五份「specified」contract，改返啲已經填好嘅窿嘅舊 statusNote 同姊妹文章（super-confirmation 嗰兩個 GitHub call site、tab navigation 嘅桌面 appearance editor、appearance-editors 嗰句「得四樣嘢」、localization 嗰句「大概一百個 key」）-- 但五份 contract 嘅 status 依然企喺 specified，因為 content.test.ts 自己有規矩話呢五版永遠唔准話自己 shipped。",
