                details: "Covers every seam from the last commit against fakes: no daemon, permission denied, a\ncontainer or volume that does not exist, a running container refused until the live-read\nrisk is explicitly accepted, the host-path-unreachable fallback to `docker cp`, the bare-\nvolume helper-container idiom, a copied-out folder that turns out not to be a world, an\nincremental copy that never deletes a stale destination file, and a cancellation that\nleaves the destination exactly where the interrupted copy found it. Also threads a runner\nthrough the IPC list/inspect handlers, which previously always reached for the real\n`docker` binary - a test-only gap that would have made this suite depend on whatever\nDocker happened to be installed on whichever machine ran it.\n\n七十四個測試,一隻 Docker 都唔使装:daemon 唔喺度、冇權限、揾唔到嗰個 container 定係 volume、\n仲開緊嘅伺服器一定要你自己講聲先至肯讀、host path 摷唔到就轉用 docker cp、淨係得個 volume 冇\ncontainer 就叫個用完即棄嘅 helper 幫手、抄咗出嚟先發現唔係個世界、增量複製唔會殺錯良民刪走\n啲舊檔案、仲有取消咗之後啲嘢原封不動咁留低。順便手術埋 IPC 嘅 list/inspect handler,以前佢哋\n會直接摷返台機真身裝咗嘅 docker 嚟問 - 唔通過依個 fixture 嘅話,成個測試套件就要睇邊台機執行\n先知道測唔測到得。",
