                subject: "Give the chrome and settings surfaces the Beacon Cartography identity",
                details: "The tab strip, the topbar, the footer, and the settings surface were the\n\"one component library reused with different copy\" the audit called out by\nname: identical 16px cards, one clamped headline size, and a flat sticky bar\nregardless of which page sat underneath it. This pass gives chrome and\nsettings their own shape, depth, and rhythm rather than only picking up the\nnew token values automatically.\n\nTopbar: flat at rest, elevation-level1 shadow and a primary/secondary/\ntertiary gradient rule fade in together once the page actually scrolls\n(main.ts's watchTopbarScrollShadow, passive and rAF-throttled). The footer\ncarries the same gradient reversed, bookending every page. The brand mark\ngets an asymmetric large/extra-small corner treatment instead of the one\nrounded square every tile on the site shared.\n\nSettings: a kicker line (\"Your browser, your rules\") above the title in\nEnglish, Cantonese and bilingual; section cards move from a single stacked\ncolumn to a responsive two-up card-wall above the shared 56.25rem\nbreakpoint; each card gets an asymmetric extra-small/20px \"filing-tab\"\nradius, a real elevation tier that lifts on hover and focus, and drops\nthat lift under prefers-reduced-motion.\n\nTabs: the active-tab indicator reads a token colour at 4px instead of 3,\nand every search field this lane owns (settings' two fields, the tab-list\nfilter row, bulk-close) is now a full pill, matching the \"this is where you\nsearch\" shape used everywhere else. Nothing about overflow, pinned,\ngrouping, drag-reorder, or keyboard/ARIA changed - TabStrip.test.ts's\nexisting 18 behavioural tests still pass unmodified, plus a new describe\nblock locking in the shape/colour additions and asserting they left the\ncompact-strip breakpoint alone.\n\nNo feature lost: the four settings tabs keep their own search, the tab\nstrip's four discovery searches and their regex builders, the context menu\nand Shift+right-click appearance editors, and the super-confirmation gate\nare all still exercised by the existing suite, unmodified, green.\n\n執位唔郁,間房重新裝修。頂欄、腳注、設定頁翻嚟翻去都係同一套卡片,而家頂欄\n滾動先現身嘅陰影同三色漸變、設定頁兩欄卡牆、tab 指示器四粒像素粗一啲,\n先至有返啲層次感。功能一條都冇拆,四個分頁搜尋、regex 建構器、右鍵選單、\nShift 右鍵編輯器全部原封不動,測試照樣綠燈。",
