                subject: "Replace the phone-width tab strip's overflow menu with scrollable tabs",
                details: "At ~390-430px a visitor got a pinned \"Home\" tab crushed to a pin glyph\nand a single letter, sitting beside an overflow button reading \"6 more,\nhiding out here\" that had eaten almost the entire bar. The overflow\nbutton had no width limit, so its full-sentence label forced\n.tab-strip__pinned's automatic flex min-size to zero (its own\noverflow-x: auto makes that safe for the container, never for what\nstays visible inside it) and the one visible pinned tab rendered only\nits first ~26px: padding, a pin icon, and the \"H\" of \"Home\".\n\nTabStrip.ts's layout() now switches to Material 3's other pattern for\na strip that cannot fit its tabs below a new COMPACT_TAB_STRIP_MAX_WIDTH\n(720px, matching this file's own pre-existing pinned-tab breakpoint):\nscrollable tabs. Nothing is measured or hidden below that width. Every\ndestination stays a real, fully labelled tab, tabs.css makes\n.tab-strip__main scroll horizontally instead of clipping, and\n.tab-strip__pinned stops shrinking below its own content so a pinned\ntab never needs to give up its label to survive. The overflow button\nnever renders, because there is nothing left for it to hold.\n\nEvery existing contract survives untouched: reordering, pinning,\ngrouping, persisted order/pins/groups/collapsed state, the four tab\ndiscovery searches with their regex builders, the per-tab and\nper-group context menus with their own search and \"Edit appearance...\"\nentries, and keyboard/ARIA tab semantics. TabStrip.test.ts (new, 18\ncases) proves the fix at phone width plus every one of those\ncontracts, and reads tabs.css's own source for the two assertions\njsdom cannot lay out for real - the same technique\ntheme/base.test.ts already uses for its [hidden] guard.\n\n一個手機用戶撞正一條壞到爆的分頁列:「主頁」分頁畀壓到得返一個圖釘同一隻字\n「H」,旁邊仲有粒掣寫住「仲有 6 頁匿喺呢度」,成條列都畀呢粒掣霸晒。原來\n嗰粒「仲有幾多頁」掣冇設寬度上限,成句字逼到隔籬個釘咗嘅分頁區凍過水,得返\n最頭嗰廿零 pixel:一個圖釘公仔加隻「H」。而家窄過 720px 就唔再玩「量到啱好\n就攞晒去藏喺掣後面」嗰套,改用 Material 3 果套「橫掃分頁」— 乜都唔使量,\n乜都唔使收埋,每個目的地都係一個完整、有齊全名嘅分頁,橫掃就得,唔使開任何\n選單。釘咗嗰個分頁區唔再畀人逼扁,嗰粒「仲有幾多頁」掣直頭唔使出場。",
