                subject: "Give appearance presets real multi-select, bulk delete and a scoped export",
                details: "The presets list only had per-row actions: apply, rename, delete one\nat a time. Every preset row now carries a checkbox, with Select all /\nClear selection acting on the whole list -- there is no search field\non this list to filter it, so unlike the notification centre \"select\nall\" here has one honest meaning rather than needing a shown-vs-total\ndistinction.\n\nDelete selected goes through the same confirmDestructive gate the\nsingle-preset delete already used, naming the real count and that the\non-screen appearance is unaffected. Export selected writes a real,\nre-importable theme file containing only the chosen presets -- not the\ncurrent on-screen look and not the rest of the saved presets, which\nthe existing plain Export button already covers. AppearanceStore\ngained deletePresets(ids) and exportPresets(ids) underneath the two\nnew buttons, both declared in destructiveActionPolicy.test.ts's\nDESTRUCTIVE_FILES alongside deletePreset and resetAllElements, with\ntheir own test coverage.\n\n以前個 preset 清單淨係得逐個郁：套用、改名、刪除，一次一個。而家每個\npreset 都有 checkbox，加埋「全選」同「清除揀選」。「刪除已揀選」照樣要\n過confirmDestructive嗰關，「匯出已揀選」就淨係將揀咗嗰幾個寫成一個真.\n正、匯入得返嘅主題檔，唔會連你而家畫面上嘅外觀或者其餘啲preset都一齊\n帶埋出去。",
