                subject: "Merge origin/main: reconcile after a same-second local/remote commit race",
                details: "Concurrent agents committed to the same tip within moments of each other -\nlocal history had already moved (this commit's search-filter fix landed as\nits own clean 3-file commit, bdc36eb) by the time origin/main advanced with\nan equivalent but differently-grouped commit carrying the same underlying\nwork bundled with unrelated concurrent changes. A clean, no-conflict merge\n(git auto-resolved every file, including the one path both sides touched)\nreconciles the two histories without rewriting either side.\n\n兩個代理喺同一刻撞埋一齊落注:本地呢邊嗰個搜尋修復已經自己分好做一個乾淨\n嘅三檔案 commit(bdc36eb),遠端嗰邊就幾乎同一時間交咗一個內容差唔多、\n但分組唔同嘅版本。合併過程冇一個檔案撞版,git 自動夾埋晒,兩邊歷史都\n冇改過,乾淨接返軌。",
                category: "other",
