                subject: "Fix docs/world-sources.md: stop claiming the desktop app wires a channel it never calls",
                details: "The \"Using one in the desktop application\" section said the map wizard's\nrelease downloader already reads any repository's checksum-list-split world,\nwith the split made invisible and a chip naming how many pieces it arrives\nin. None of that is true against the actual UI: ReleaseDownloads.vue (the\ncomponent the section is describing) only calls download:discover/\ndownload:start, which understand this project's own <name>.parts.json\nmanifest and nothing else. main/worldsource/ipc.ts registers five real,\ntested channels - worldsource:parse/discover/fetch/cancel/active - and the\npreload exposes all five, but grepping design/packages/ui for any of them\nturns up zero call sites. A repository field being present proves nothing\nhere: the existing downloader already has one, for a different, narrower\npurpose, and would show a checksum-list release as a pile of individually\nunfetchable parts rather than the one world main/worldsource/ would make of\nit.\n\nThis is a doc correction, not a feature change: main/worldsource/ is real,\nfinished and covered by 51 tests per this file's own Verification section,\nwhich still stands unchanged. What was wrong was describing UI wiring that\ndoes not exist as though pressing a button already did this. Replaced the\nclaim with an explicit warning naming the exact channels, the exact file\nthat should call them and does not, and why a superficial \"it has a\nrepository field\" check would miss the gap. The GitHub Actions section is\nunaffected and untouched: it never depended on the desktop app.\n\n修正 docs/world-sources.md：唔好再講個桌面程式已經駁咗一條佢從來冇打過嘅頻道\n\n「Using one in the desktop application」嗰段一直話個地圖精靈嘅 release\ndownloader 已經識自動讀任何 repository、用 checksum list 分割嘅世界，\n仲話個分割會變到隱形，有個 chip 講埋分幾多份。查返實際 UI，呢啲全部\n都係假：ReleaseDownloads.vue（呢段文字講緊嘅嗰個 component）淨係識叫\ndownload:discover/download:start，呢兩個只識呢個項目自己嘅\n<name>.parts.json manifest，第樣就乜都唔識。main/worldsource/ipc.ts\n明明就有五條真、有測試嘅頻道——worldsource:parse/discover/fetch/cancel/\nactive——preload 都五條齊齊暴露咗出嚟，但係成個 design/packages/ui 搜\n一次，一條都冇人叫過。有個 repository 輸入框喺度乜都證明唔到：舊有嗰個\ndownloader 本身都有一個，但係做緊第樣、範圍窄好多嘅嘢，遇到 checksum-\nlist 嘅 release 佢只會顯示做一堆各自散開、下載唔到嘅碎片，而唔係\nmain/worldsource/ 應該整出嚟嗰一個完整世界。\n\n呢個係文件修正，唔係功能改動：main/worldsource/ 係真、係完成咗，仲有\n51 個測試守住（睇返呢份文件自己嗰段 Verification，冇改過）。錯嘅係\n講緊一啲根本冇駁過嘅 UI 連線，講到好似撳個掣就已經做到咁。而家改咗做\n一句明確嘅警告，講明係邊五條頻道、邊個檔案應該叫但係冇叫，同埋點解淨\n係睇「有冇 repository 輸入框」係睇唔出呢個漏洞嘅。GitHub Actions 嗰段\n冇受影響、完全冇改：佢由頭到尾都唔靠桌面程式。",
