                shortSha: "584a4ba0c1",
                date: "2026-08-05T14:02:12-04:00",
                subject: "Give the landing page a real hero, tonal stat cards, and a beginner's path",
                details: "The hero used to be one bordered box in a sea of empty right-hand gutter,\nits title never climbing past headline-sized text, and its best evidence\n(the stat and engine cards) sat 950px below the fold where a first-time\nvisitor never saw it. It is now a two-zone band: the pitch on the left at\na real display-medium size, and the first four stats pulled up as a 2x2\ntonal preview on the right, each on its own primary/secondary/tertiary/\nneutral container instead of the one flat surface every card on the page\nused to share. The same four container roles now cycle across the full\nstat grid and the two engine cards below, with a hover elevation lift\ninstead of a static outline, so the \"vibrant seed-derived scheme\" the\ntoken file always declared finally reaches the canvas. The documentation\nindex moved from a uniform stack of settings-list rows to a responsive\ntile grid, corners stepped down to a smaller radius than the hero's,\nbecause a catalogue of forty articles is not one long list.\n\nAlso new: a \"New here? Start with this\" section right after the hero,\nthree plain steps and the same Java/Mojang disclosure the desktop app's\nown first-run welcome screen opens with, reworded for someone who has\nnever opened the app and does not yet know what a \"world\" or a \"map\" is.\nIt links straight to the site's own glossary article rather than\nrepeating its definitions a second time. Every existing feature survives\nuntouched: the download button's three release states, the engine\ndata-runs flag and its exact semantics, every outbound link, the article\ndisclosure's native keyboard semantics and status pill, and the full\n246-test site suite plus typecheck, build and lint all still pass.\n\n個首頁以前得返個孤零零嘅方框，右邊成片留白乜都冇，標題大極都唔會大得起，\n仲有嗰堆最有說服力嘅數字卡同引擎卡，全部瞓喺頁面尾950像素度，第一次嚟嘅\n人根本睇唔到。而家改做兩欄式：左邊繼續嗰句口號，字體終於用返display級數；\n右邊擺返頭四個數字做2x2縮圖，一人一個primary/secondary/tertiary/中性色底，\n唔再全部同一舊灰色。成個數字格仔、兩張引擎卡都跟住呢四種色轉，滑鼠一放\n仲有陰影浮起嚟，token檔早就寫低嘅「繽紛配色」終於畀人睇得出。文檔索引由\n一條長長嘅settings-list變返做磚頭格仔牆，圓角細過個hero，因為四十篇文章\n唔應該係一條直路。\n\n仲加咗個「新手？由呢度開始」板塊，就喺hero後面：三步曲，同desktop app\nfirst-run歡迎畫面嗰句Java同Mojang嘅老實話一樣，改到啱哂一個未開過個app、\n唔知乜嘢係「world」「map」嘅網頁訪客睇。佢直接撳掣去site自己嗰篇glossary，\n唔會將啲定義照抄多次。原有功能一樣冇少：下載掣三種狀態、引擎data-runs\n旗仔同佢嘅意思、每條出站連結、文章disclosure嘅原生鍵盤操作同狀態徽章，\n成套246個測試加埋typecheck、build、lint全部照樣過關。",
