                subject: "Bring HANDOFF and ROADMAP up to the current tip after the UI-defect wave",
                details: "The last handoff entry was stamped at commit 9d8de68; the tree has moved 24\ncommits since. Adds one new dated HANDOFF entry covering everything in\nbetween: the FAB stack painting over page text (and the \"ninth instance\"\nthat turned out to be the eighth seen through a doorway), the Cantonese\nfunny-level caption landing on its own tick label, docked panels that\ndid not scroll (two separate bugs, not one), the whole GUI wearing a hand\ncursor because of Vuetify's own [aria-controls] rule reaching the wrapper\naround every element, four ellipsis-with-no-tooltip fixes and the shared\n<v-list-item :title> prop-versus-attribute trap behind three of them, a\nper-render account picker deliberately kept local rather than global, the\ncapture sweep's two real bugs (backup resume re-uploading every part,\nand a settings-tabs harness regression), the Java-render-default decision\nwritten into D17 as a standing amendment, and the visual audit itself as\nthe method that caught what no assertion did. Also corrects a claim this\nsame file was still making after it stopped being true: the private-repo\nPages 403 mapping and large-map staging time, both flagged \"untested\" in\nthe last entry, were proven for real by issue #44's closing evidence and\nthat paragraph is rewritten to say so, in both files.\n\nThe plain-language summary's \"last checked\" stamp moves to commit 56b1293.\nHosted CI is stated honestly rather than optimistically: the last run to\nactually finish is 31023005393 (green, commit c533c8c, build.378), and\nroughly twenty commits pushed after it are still queued or in progress -\na real backlog from this pass's push rate, not a known failure, and both\nfiles now say so instead of implying either \"still red\" or \"surely green.\"\nROADMAP.md's test-count and issue-count paragraphs are reconciled to match\n(37 closed issues, zero open; 478 files/7,392 tests from the same hosted\nrun) alongside the same #44 correction.\n\n一次過幫 HANDOFF 同 ROADMAP 追返晒喺 commit 9d8de68 之後嗰廿幾個 commit 做過嘅\n嘢:粒速控掣印住成頁字、廣東話搞笑程度個描述疊住自己個「1」字、泊定嘅面板\n轆唔到(其實係兩單唔同嘅嘢)、成隻程式冇端端戴住手套(Vuetify 個\naria-controls 規矩由粒細掣散到成個外觀包裝紙度)、四單「...」剪咗字之後冇得\n停低隻手指睇返全名(仲搵到 Vuetify 個 title prop 唔係真 attribute 嗰單陷阱)、\nCI render 嗰張卡加咗個「用邊個帳戶嚟算」嘅本地揀擇、測試掃描搵到嘅兩單真\nbug(backup 復原重新上晒成份嘢、settings 分頁截圖機器人跟唔切改版)、Java\n引擎正式寫低做企定嘅預設值,同埋果次由頭到尾睇晒六十六張相嘅視覺審查本身\n就係搵到呢啲嘢嘅方法。仲執返一單:呢份文件自己都仲寫住「私人 repo 個 403\n提示未試過、大地圖嘅上傳時間都未量過」,但其實 issue #44 早已經用真數據證\n明咗兩樣都得,而家兩份文件都改返做老實講。CI 狀態都寫得老實啲:最後一次真\n係跑完嘅 hosted CI 係 c533c8c(build.378),之後成廿個 commit 都仲排緊隊,\n唔係跑壞咗,係俾自己嘅推送速度追過咗頭。",
