                subject: "Give the placement chooser, the new-tab picker and the overflow list a search field",
                details: "Three context menus were still bare fixed v-lists with no way to filter them, the last\nholdouts against the \"every context menu carries its own search field\" contract:\nDockedSurface.vue's placement chooser (5 placements plus 2 reset rows), and TabStrip.vue's\nnew-tab picker and tab-overflow list. Both files were left \"pending\" in\nmenuCoverage.test.ts's own registry by an earlier pass because they belonged to another\nlane at the time; they are fair game now, so both are actually fixed rather than deferred\nagain.\n\nThe placement chooser and the new-tab picker wire a ConfigSearchField directly to their\nexisting markup rather than swapping in MenuSearchList, because their rows keep things\nMenuSearchList does not render: prepend icons, and the placement chooser's own\nmenuitemradio selection state. The overflow list does the same, plus a new pure function,\ntabModel.ts's filterHiddenSegments, that narrows a group segment to just its matching\nmembers (or keeps it whole when the group's own name matches) rather than dropping it\noutright - proven directly against fixtures since jsdom has no layout engine to ever force\na real overflow inside a mounted component. menuCoverage.test.ts's registry now reads\nhas-search for both files, and mounted regression tests (DockedSurface's placement chooser,\nTabbedNavigation's new-tab picker) prove the filtering, the honest no-match state and\nEscape-clears-before-close actually work, all of which fail against the prior bare-list\nmarkup.\n\n三個右鍵選單一直淨係得個死物 list,冇得搵嘢:DockedSurface.vue 個位置揀選器(5 個位置\n加 2 個重設)、TabStrip.vue 個開新分頁揀選器同埋分頁爆咗嗰個溢出清單。呢兩個檔案之前\n畀第個 lane 揸住所以擺咗喺 menuCoverage.test.ts 度話「遲啲先算」,而家冇人揸住,即刻執\n返好佢,唔再拖。\n\n位置揀選器同開新分頁揀選器直接掛個 ConfigSearchField 落去現有嘅 markup,冇用\nMenuSearchList,因為佢哋啲行仲有 icon 同(位置揀選器嗰邊)menuitemradio 揀緊邊個嘅狀\n態,MenuSearchList 唔識畫呢啲。溢出清單都係咁做,仲加咗個純函數\ntabModel.ts 嘅 filterHiddenSegments,一組入面淨係揀啱嗰啲留低(組名啱就成組留低),唔\n係一係全留一係全丟——直接攞 fixture 試,因為 jsdom 冇排版引擎,測試裝個組件係逼唔到佢\n真係爆版。menuCoverage.test.ts 個名單而家兩個檔案都寫 has-search,重加咗掛住組件試嘅\n迴歸測試(DockedSurface 位置揀選器、TabbedNavigation 開新分頁揀選器),證實搵嘢、揀唔\n到嗰句老實話、同 Escape 先清後閂全部真係work——擺返舊嗰版死 list 落去,呢啲測試即刻死\n畀你睇。",
