                date: "2026-08-05T13:23:55-04:00",
                subject: "Recapture the six render-*.png screenshots with real consent, and cite them in eula-and-consent.md",
                details: "A prior pass left docs/screenshots/render-1-wizard-world.png through render-6-map.png\nstale and unreferenced, on purpose: reaching them for real needs the app's own Mojang\ndownload consent, and the only consent offered that pass arrived as an unverifiable\nmid-task relay from another agent, correctly declined. This time the user said it\nthemselves, in the main conversation, twice, so the block that mattered came off. The\nsix images are a fresh, real run: a world typed into the make-a-map wizard, the review\nstep's real consent warning, consent accepted through the real Settings row, BlueMap's\nown Java engine downloading Minecraft's client file from Mojang for real and rendering\nthe world, and the finished map opened in the viewer. docs/eula-and-consent.md described\nthis exact path in prose and had no picture anywhere in it; it has six now, placed right\nafter the sentence they prove.\n\nSix screenshots that could not lawfully be taken finally got taken, because someone with\nthe actual authority to say \"yes\" said it, in words, to a human who was actually listening\n- which is more than can be said for most of Mojang's own EULA readers. render-4-start.png\nand render-5-running.png look almost the same; that is not a bug in this commit, it is a\nregion of Minecraft rendering in about two seconds flat, which is either impressive\nengineering or a very small world, and in this case it was both.\n\n六張影唔到嘅相,終於影到,因為真係識講「得」嗰個人,真係開咗聲,講俾一個真係有聽嘅\n人聽 - 呢一點,已經贏咗大部份睇 Mojang EULA 嗰啲人。之前嗰輪特登唔影呢六張\nrender-*.png,係因為要真係俾咗 Mojang 下載同意先影得誠實,而嗰陣半路殺出嚟嗰句\n「已經同意」係第二個 agent 講嘅,唔係用家親口講,梗係唔收。今次用家自己喺傾偈度\n講咗兩次,梗有得郁。呢六張相,係一次真嘅行程:喺 wizard 度打個世界入去、撞到\nreview 步嗰個同意警告、喺真正嘅 Settings 度撳咗真嘅同意、BlueMap 自己嘅 Java 引擎\n真係去 Mojang 攞咗 Minecraft client 檔案嚟真係 render 個世界,最後喺 viewer 度打開\n幅圖。docs/eula-and-consent.md 本身就係講緊呢條路,但成篇文一張圖都冇 - 而家有六張,\n擺喺證明緊嗰句嘢後面。render-4-start.png 同 render-5-running.png 睇落好似,唔係\n呢個 commit 有錯,係嗰嚿 Minecraft 兩秒就 render 完,呢個係工程勁定係個世界細,\n兩樣都啱。",
                category: "docs",
                areas: ["docs"],
                files: 8,
