                subject: "Make Java the standing render default, not a placeholder for the gate",
                details: "The Phase D parity gate closed 2026-08-04 (byte-identical oracle at both\nfixture sizes), but nothing was wired to notice, and D17's own text still\nread \"until the TypeScript mesher passes the gate\" - a promise that the\ngate closing would switch the product over. It does not, on purpose: the\nscout already found nothing prefers the TypeScript engine anywhere in the\nwiring (local, Docker, remote SSH and CI-render all resolve through the\nsame upstreamJavaEngine), and this closes the paper trail to match. D17\ngets a dated amendment (never a rewrite) making the Java engine a standing\ndefault rather than an interval placeholder; the pin test that guards\nresolveEngine's return value already existed beside the orchestrator's own\ntests from an earlier session and still passes untouched. ROADMAP.md, the\njava-render-path site article and HANDOFF's glossary entry all carried the\nsame stale \"until it passes\" framing and are corrected to match. No\nengine-choice UI exists anywhere in the app to update; the two read-only\nsurfaces that display which engine ran already default to and say Java.\n\n個 Phase D 關卡 2026-08-04 已經過咗，兩個引擎榨出嚟嘅位元一模一樣，但冇人同\nD17 講一聲，成份文件仲寫住「等到 TypeScript 網面過關」，好似關卡一過就會自\n動轉軚咁。事實係唔會：探子已經搵過成個 wiring，本地、Docker、遠端 SSH 同\nCI 全部都係經同一個 upstreamJavaEngine，冇一處揀 TypeScript。而家幫 D17 加\n返個有日期嘅修訂（唔係推倒重寫），話明 Java 係企定嘅預設值，唔係借嚟頂檔\n嘅過渡安排。釘死 resolveEngine 嘅測試其實舊 session 已經寫低咗放喺\norchestrator 測試隔籬，冚唪唥照跑照過。ROADMAP、java-render-path 呢篇文同\nHANDOFF 嘅詞彙表都跟住execute修正返，唔再講「等關卡過」。成個 app 搵唔到\n揀引擎嘅介面，兩個得個睇字冇得揀嘅位都已經預設同講緊 Java。",
                category: "docs",
                areas: ["docs", "shell", "site"],
                files: 5,
