                subject: "Give automatic repair a site article; fix two stale facts and a missing roadmap credit",
                details: "Batch 3 of the audit findings: the automatic-repair feature (docs/automatic-repair.md,\nmain/repair, ui/components/repair) had 105+10 passing tests and zero presence on the\ndocs site, so this adds its article and wires it into the reading graph from\nconfig-history and render-console. viewer-remote-mode.ts told readers local rendering\n\"does not exist yet\" while the site's own java-render-path article proves it does\n(decision D17, shipped and unit tested); that self-contradiction is corrected in both\nthe status note and the suggested-reading line that repeated it. Both design/ROADMAP.md\nand home.ts's mirrored table said Phase I was flatly \"Pending\" after the update checker\nhad already shipped and wired into the main process, and separately left the real,\ntested SQL-storage landing (issue #32, closed) out of Phase H's note entirely; both rows\nnow say so, in both places. A regression test per fix, all failing against the prior\ntext.\n\n粵語：修復功能靚仔靚女咁做完嘢，做咗105條test都冇人喺個網站度提過佢,\n而家有返自己嘅文章,連去config-history同render-console。仲有果句「本機起圖仲未有」\n講得成日都冇更新過,but java-render-path篇文一早話咗有,自己打自己嘴巴,而家改返啱。\nROADMAP同首頁個表都話update checker「未做」,但佢一早著咗喺主程式度;SQL storage\n都做完通過咗真MySQL/MariaDB/PostgreSQL測試,個表居然冇提,而家兩份文件都補返。\n每個改動都有regression test,舊嘅錯文一定fail比佢睇。",
