                subject: "Audit the whole session against reality: 24 done, 2 partial, one stale summary caught",
                details: "A Sonnet auditor checked all 26 requests from this session against the actual\ntree, the actual tests, the actual issue board and actual hosted CI state,\nrather than trusting any prior agent's \"done.\" Most of it holds up: 24 of 26\nitems have real code, a real guard test, or both, and several (path-field\nbrowse buttons, config-field explanations, the regex-builder policy) are\nenforced by a structural sweep that fails loudly on the next regression\nrather than a spot check that only catches what it already knew to look for.\n\nTwo gaps, both self-inflicted rather than hidden: six render-*.png\nscreenshots were never recaptured and never removed either, sitting in the\nexact \"neither current nor gone\" state the project's own prior pass already\nrecommended fixing and didn't; and HANDOFF.md's own plain-language summary\nstill calls the private-repo Pages 403 mapping \"untested\" a full pass after\nissue #44's own closing comment proved it for real - a stale sentence\nsitting one paragraph above a rule that says stale sentences aren't allowed\nto sit there. Also flagged: fourteen recent commits have no finished hosted\nCI run yet, so \"the code is right\" and \"the hosted proof exists\" are, right\nnow, two different claims for about a third of this table.\n\n一個 Sonnet 稽核員將呢一輪session講過嘅廿六樣嘢,逐樣同真實嘅程式碼、真嘅測試、真嘅\nissue board、真嘅hosted CI狀態對過,唔係人講就信。大部分都經得起考:廿六樣入面有\n廿四樣有真程式碼、真嘅守門測試,又或者兩樣都有,仲有幾樣(路徑欄嘅瀏覽掣、設定欄\n嘅解釋、regex builder嘅規矩)係用成個掃描去逼住守嘅,唔係得個「睇吓有冇」。\n\n漏低兩樣,都係自己攞嚟嘅,唔係執到嘅:六張render-*.png相一直冇再影過,又冇刪走,\n卡喺個「唔係新又唔係冇」嘅尷尬位,呢個項目自己上一輪都話要執但冇執過。仲有\nHANDOFF.md自己個開場白,成段過去之後仲話私人repo嘅Pages 403提示「未試過」——但\nissue #44自己個收尾comment早就真係試過。呢句過時嘅嘢,就企喺一條話「唔准過時」\n嘅規矩上面一段。仲有:十四個新commit未等到hosted CI行完,所以而家「程式碼啱」同\n「hosted證據有」係兩件唔同嘅事,成張表大約三分之一都係咁。",
                category: "docs",
