                date: "2026-08-05T12:53:17-04:00",
                subject: "Fix EULA export rows that dim with no stated reason: the doc comment already promised one",
                details: "MenuSearchList.vue's own MenuSearchItem doc comment already claimed a\ndisabled row could carry \"an optional reason the row is temporarily\nunavailable\" - the interface never had one, only a boolean disabled flag,\nso a screen reader heard \"dimmed\" and nothing else and a sighted person got\na greyed-out row with no way to learn what would un-grey it. EulaViewer.vue's\nthree section-scoped Export rows (as Markdown/as plain text/copy this\nsection) hit exactly this gap whenever no section is open: disabled, silent,\nand - confirmed by re-reading EulaViewer.test.ts's own header comment, which\nalready claimed this exact behaviour was covered - genuinely untested. Adds\n`reason?: string` to MenuSearchItem, rendered as the row's own subtitle\nthrough a conditional v-bind spread (exactOptionalPropertyTypes rejects an\nexplicit undefined on a prop that does not declare it), wires EulaViewer's\nthree rows to it with a new FIXED string, and drives the real tab-close\nbutton twice in a mounted test to reach activeSection === null the honest\nway rather than through private state.\n\nMenuSearchList.vue 自己個 MenuSearchItem 文檔註解一早就話咗,dimmed 嗰行\n可以帶多一句「因乜嘢暫時用唔到」嘅解釋 -- 但個介面淨係得返一個 disabled\n嘅 true/false,冇嗰句解釋嘅位。搞到讀屏軟件淨係聽到「dimmed」就冇下文,\n睇得見嘅人望住粒灰晒嘅掣,都唔知要點做先可以撳得。EulaViewer.vue 嗰三\n行淨係限定某一節先用得嘅「匯出」掣(Markdown/純文字/複製呢節),一路都\n中咗呢個窿:未開節嗰陣,靜雞雞就灰晒,重點係 EulaViewer.test.ts 自己個\n頭述已經寫咗話呢樣嘢有測試蓋到 -- 但其實冇。而家幫 MenuSearchItem 加咗\n個 reason?: string,用 v-bind 有條件咁夾埋去做個副標題(exactOptional\nPropertyTypes 唔畀個冇宣告 undefined 嘅 prop 收 undefined),EulaViewer\n嗰三行掣接咗條新嘅固定字串,測試度仲真係撳兩次個關閉分頁掣,老老實實\n逼到 activeSection 變返 null,唔係靠偷睇私有狀態。",
