                subject: "Fix the bottom-left FAB stack painting over page text at every width and scale",
                details: "A visual audit of the current screenshot set (docs/visual-audit-2026-08-05.md)\nfound the Settings/config/licence FAB stack, fixed to the bottom-left corner,\npainting directly over scrolled-to text in nine screenshots across six\nsurfaces - \"Rendering\" reading \"ndering\", \"Pick an account\" reading \"ck an\naccount\" - and at higher display scales sitting on top of an actual radio\nbutton rather than merely a heading. `.mb-shell-fabs` is `position: fixed`,\nso it always floats over whatever `.mb-world-host` (the shared scroll host\nfor World, Projects, CI-render, Servers, Backups, Pages, Docs and the\noptions editor) has scrolled to; nothing reserved it any clearance. Gives\nthat host a permanent left gutter sized to the stack's own footprint (12px\ninset + 48px button, plus room to spare), for its whole scrollable height\nrather than only what is on screen when a page first opens, since scrolling\ncan carry any part of the content into the stack's fixed band. A new\nCSS-source regression test ties the gutter's width to the stack's own\ngeometry so the two numbers cannot drift apart un-noticed, and confirms\nevery page host still gets it.\n\n一直有粒浮埋喺左下角嘅速控掣(設定、開檔、律法三粒),打橫踩住成頁嘢喺度\n遊水:張相執到「Rendering」淨返「ndering」,「Pick an account」淨返「ck an\naccount」,大縮放仲直接坐咗喺個單選掣度。粒掣係死釘喺畫面嘅,冇話留返\n啲位俾佢,搞到咩內容捲上嚟都有機會撞正佢。而家喺個共用嘅捲動容器度留返\n一撇左邊嘅安全位,尺寸跟返粒掣自己嘅闊度,成個捲動範圍都有,唔止得頭\n先開嗰吓見到嘅果幾吋。加咗個讀原始碼嘅回歸測試,將呢兩個數綁埋一齊,\n確保之後改極都唔會靜雞雞走位。",
