                subject: "Record a screenshot-by-screenshot visual audit of the current build",
                details: "The tab strip, the EULA viewer, the docked settings panels and their\nscrollbars, the notification centre, the accounts list, and the\ndestructive-action gates all held up under actual eyeballs: 66 current\ncaptures checked pixel by pixel, and most of them are exactly as\nadvertised. What did not hold up is a bottom-left utility button stack\nthat has apparently never met a scrollbar it didn't want to stand in\nfront of - it paints straight over page text (and, at 1.5x-2x scale,\nstraight over an actual radio button) in nine separate screenshots\nacross six different screens. The Cantonese \"funny level\" slider caption\nalso decided the number 1 needed a roommate and moved in on top of it,\nin two places. Findings, exact obscured text, confidence levels and\nlane ownership are all in design/docs/visual-audit-2026-08-05.md.\n\n執到粒糖咁款,揸支放大鏡由頭睇到尾:六十六張最新截圖,一張都冇走漏。\n分頁條、EULA閱讀器、side panel嗰啲scrollbar、通知中心、帳戶清單、\n刪除前嗰重重關卡,全部經得起檢驗,靚仔靚女企定定。但係個喺左下角\n嗰粒「掣仔堆」就唔啦更—佢完全唔識揀位,成日企埋去頁面文字前面擋\n晒字,仲要喺1.5x同2x放大嗰陣直情瞓喺個radio button度,九張圖入面\n出現咗六次,認真離譜。仲有廣東話嗰句「搞笑程度」滑桿嗰句「中間落\n墨」都幾串,兩個地方都揸埋個「1」字唔放,重晒疊。全部證據、揸實\n嘅文字、信心程度同邊條線負責,寫晒喺 design/docs/visual-audit-2026-08-05.md。",
