                subject: "Release notes: link the changelog they never mentioned",
                details: "Audited v0.1.0-build.370 against this project's own release checklist and found\nevery required element present except one: the Squirrel installer, the workflow\ntiming block, the line-count table and the agent/human split are all in the notes;\na changelog is not. CHANGELOG.md has carried every commit's full SHA since it was\nwritten, and the release notes never once pointed at it - not in this release, not\nin any release checked back to build.364. The notes were composing a table of\nexactly what got measured and never mentioning the one file that says what changed.\n\nFuture releases only: the \"Compose release notes\" step now appends a \"## Changelog\"\nsection linking CHANGELOG.md at the exact commit being released. Does not touch any\nalready-published release's notes, per this task's own instructions never to edit a\nshipped release. Described the regeneration honestly rather than overclaiming: it is\nrun by hand before a release is cut, not gated by CI (the existing \"Lint the workflow\nfiles\" job comment already explains why a changelog-freshness gate is unsatisfiable\nby construction). actionlint and a targeted shellcheck pass on the touched block clean.\n\nRelease notes:漏咗嗰句「仲有本流水帳可以睇」,而家補返\n\n攞返 v0.1.0-build.370 對過呢個 project 自己嗰張 release 清單,發現成張清單淨係\n漏咗一項:Squirrel 安裝包、workflow 跑幾耐嗰段、計數表、agent 同人類寫嘅比例,\n樣樣都齊,獨獨唔見 changelog。CHANGELOG.md 明明由開始寫嗰陣就一早幫每個 commit\n都貼好齊 SHA,但 release notes 從來未指過一次去嗰度睇——唔止呢個 release,\n追返去 build.364 嗰堆全部一樣,一張表寫到明「量咗啲乜」,就係唔提「改咗啲乜」\n嗰本流水帳擺喺邊。\n\n淨係影響以後嘅 release:composing release notes 嗰步而家多咗一段「## Changelog」,\n連去 release 嗰粒 commit 嗰份 CHANGELOG.md。冇碰過任何已經出咗嘅 release 個\nnotes,跟足呢個任務自己嗰條規矩——出咗嘅唔准再改。講法都老老實實冇吹大:呢個\n生成係人手撳嘅,唔係 CI 逼住做(「Lint the workflow files」個 job 自己嗰段\ncomment 早就解釋過點解要逼住做係做唔到嘅)。actionlint 同針對呢段嘅 shellcheck\n都乾淨。",
