                date: "2026-08-05T11:11:21-04:00",
                subject: "Stamp HANDOFF and ROADMAP to the green tip: CI run 31013825875, release v0.1.0-build.370, zero open issues",
                details: "Both files had been quietly lying for a while: HANDOFF's own plain-language summary\nclaimed \"Phase C's exit criteria are still unproven\" three hundred lines above a dated\nentry proving the opposite, and its \"state of the automated checks\" section spent a\nwhole subsection insisting CI was red at a commit eleven commits behind the tip it was\nsupposed to be describing. ROADMAP's \"Hosted CI\" section was still written in the voice\nof a pass that had never gone green, because until this commit it never had.\n\nThis commit does not change any of that history - it stops the docs from contradicting\nit. Added one comprehensive dated HANDOFF entry naming all four causes that actually got\nhosted CI green (an i18n warning flood tripping vitest's own RPC heartbeat, the retry\nwrapper plus the pngjs esbuild crash it exposed, two settings-history isolation bugs\nacross eulaStorage/MarkerMenu and four sibling stores, and the Screenshots job's own\npermanently-invisible EULA-panel twin), plus the map-id sanitizer fix (#47) and Phase C's\nclose (#31/#46) that landed in the same window. Refreshed the plain-language summary's\n\"last checked\" stamp to commit 9d8de68, fixed its two internally-contradicting stale\nclaims, and updated the Pages-publish and large-world caveats to say exactly what issues\n#44 and #39 did and did not prove rather than what they hadn't gotten to yet. ROADMAP's\n\"Hosted CI\" and \"Open going into the next pass\" sections now match the actual issue\nboard (eighteen closed, #28 through #47, zero open) instead of a punch list half of\nwhich was already done. Pulled the real 478-file/7,384-passed/0-failed count straight\nfrom the green run's own job log rather than re-running the suite locally to guess at it.\n\n執返 HANDOFF 同 ROADMAP 兩本流水帳,追到最新嗰個綠燈 tip:CI run 31013825875,\nrelease v0.1.0-build.370,issue board 見底,清零\n\n呢兩本流水帳一直靜雞雞講大話:HANDOFF 自己嗰段「畀白痴都睇得明」嘅摘要,頭先仲寫住\n「Phase C 都仲未證實得到」,跟落去三百幾行之後居然自己有段日期記錄講到明證實咗;\n「自動檢查嘅現狀」嗰段仲要企硬喺一個執輸咗十一個 commit 嘅舊 tip 度,一口咬定\nCI 仲係紅嘅。ROADMAP 嗰段「Hosted CI」都仲係用嗰種「呢一輪從來未試過綠燈」嘅口吻寫\n——因為喺呢個 commit 之前,佢真係從來未試過。\n\n呢個 commit 唔係改歷史,淨係唔畀文件再打自己臉。加咗一段完整嘅 HANDOFF 日期記錄,\n講清楚四個唔同原因點樣先真係整到 CI 變綠(vue-i18n 嘅警告海嘯拖冧 vitest 自己嗰條\nRPC 心跳線、補完個 retry wrapper 之後又拆穿 pngjs 喺 esbuild 度嗰個炸彈、eulaStorage\n同 MarkerMenu 呢類「隔離失敗」嘅蟲、同埋 Screenshots 個 job 自己匿埋嗰個永遠見唔到\n光嘅 EULA 孖生兄弟),仲有同一輪落地嘅 map-id 消毒 fix(#47)同埋 Phase C 埋單\n(#31/#46)。摘要嗰段「最後對過」嘅時間戳都追到 commit 9d8de68,順手拆咗兩句自己打\n自己嘴嘅舊講法,Pages 出版同大世界嗰兩句注腳都改到準確講清楚 #44 同 #39 真係證實咗\n乜、仲未證實乜,唔再係「仲未搞到」嗰種舊講法。ROADMAP 嗰段「Hosted CI」同「下一輪\n要做嘅嘢」而家對得上真正嘅 issue board(十八個已關,#28 到 #47,清零),唔再係一張\n一半都已經做咗嘅老舊清單。仲有真數:478 個測試檔、7,384 個過、0 個失敗,呢個係直接\n喺個綠燈 run 自己嘅 job log 度攞出嚟,唔係本機重新跑一次去估。",
