                details: "Same bug a sibling commit (e569e47) already found and fixed in\neulaStorage.ts, present in four more files this session wired into the\nsame history mirror: appearanceStore.ts, palettePrefs.ts,\ndockPlacement.ts and tabStorage.ts each called recordAppSetting AFTER\nthe \"if (storage === null) return;\" guard, so a build with no\nlocalStorage at all - private browsing, a blocked storage API, any\ntest that passes null - returned before the mirror was ever reached,\nsilently dropping the one case the mirror exists to be independent of.\nAn earlier working-tree edit fixed all five files identically; a\nbackground sync commit landed the other four before that fix reached\nthem, and only eulaStorage.ts's own test caught it before this pass\nnoticed the rest.\n\ntabStorage.test.ts's own committed test had the wrong assertion too -\nit expected recordAppSetting NOT to be called with no storage, which\nis the bug's own behaviour written down as the spec. All four files'\ntests now assert what the doc comment beside each call always claimed:\nthe mirror fires whether or not local storage exists at all. 127\ntests, 4 files, all green; vue-tsc clean.\n\n之前嗰單「有紙都要出聲,冇紙都要出聲」嘅蟲,原來唔止咬親 eulaStorage.ts 一間\n——appearanceStore、palettePrefs、dockPlacement、tabStorage 呢四間房都中晒\n招,個咪高峰全部裝喺個 return 後面,冇 storage 就即刻閃人,講都冇機會講。\n仲要慘過中招:tabStorage 個 test 仲喺度企錯隊,寫住「唔通知先啱」,即係將\n個 bug 嗰句寫成規格書。今次四間房一次過翻修,個 test 都改返做「梗係要出聲」\n先啱。",
