                subject: "Finish wiring every localStorage settings store into the history mirror",
                details: "Completes the settings-history migration a prior session started: menuPrefs\nwas wired and eleven other localStorage-backed stores were named but left\nuntouched. Every one of them now calls recordAppSetting from wherever it\nalready writes localStorage - appearance, dock placement, palette size,\nremote render targets, the EULA viewer's own tabs, the marker filters\npanel, the chosen map storage folder, language mode, both funny-level\nsliders, dismissed-update tracking, and all four tab strips tabStorage.ts\nbacks, each namespaced by its own storage key so they cannot collide.\n\nTwo keys are excluded on purpose rather than silently skipped: dock size\nand dock floating position fire on every pointermove frame of a drag,\nwhich would turn one resize into dozens of history revisions of noise.\nBoth are named with their reason in appSettingsHistorySync.ts's own\nEXCLUDED_APP_SETTINGS list, and a new Node-environment test file reads\nevery wired store's real source off disk to prove the manifest is not\njust a list somebody typed and hoped was still true.\n\nThe bulk of the wiring landed in an interim sync commit from this same\nsession (20613ea); this commit adds the two test files that commit missed\n(eulaStorage.test.ts, appSettingsHistoryManifest.test.ts) and brings\ndocs/config-history.md's own status table up to date - it previously\nstill described eleven stores as \"not yet wired.\"\n\n跟返之前個 agent 開咗頭嘅路:menuPrefs 早就駁咗線,剩低嗰十一個\nlocalStorage 舖頭就淨係得個名冇埋牙。今次逐間執:appearance、dock\nplacement、palette size、remote targets、EULA 個 tab 排位、marker\nfilters 開關、map storage 資料夾、language mode、兩條 funny-level\n滑桿、update 已解散記錄,仲有 tabStorage.ts 揸住嗰四條 tab strip,\n個個都駁埋條線,各自用返自己個 storage key 嚟分身,唔會撞埋一份。\n\n淨係兩條刻意唔駁:dock 嘅 size 同 floating position,因為呢兩樣嘢\n拖一拖就狂寫,一嗲手指拖到出幾十個歷史版本,全部都係噪音。呢兩條\n喺 EXCLUDED_APP_SETTINGS 度寫低原因,唔係靜雞雞唔理得,仲加咗個\n測試去讀晒每個舖頭嘅真source code嚟核實條清單冇作大。",
