                subject: "Revert \"Remove WebServer\": that gap now belongs to a dedicated session",
                details: "This reverts commit 07bab3e294f86207135df65b4d677d44c8e0bff6, pushed\nmoments before a scope correction arrived: a separate session has been\nstarted specifically to decide runtime/webserver.ts's WebServer fate,\nand this task's own remaining scope is the localStorage history wiring\nand issue #31's modded-pack parity, not this class. The analysis in\n07bab3e is not wrong, it is just not this session's call to make\nanymore, so the class, its test, the runtime barrel export and the two\ndocs it touched all come back exactly as they were.\n\n啱啱先幫 WebServer 執完骨,轉頭就收到通知:呢單嘢而家有專人跟開,唔使我\n呢邊搶住做。刀放低,嘢執返轉頭——個 class、佢個 test、runtime barrel 嗰\n行 export,同兩份文件,原封不動搬返轉去,留返畀嗰個專門 session 慢慢\n諗掂佢。",
