                date: "2026-08-05T05:59:26-04:00",
                subject: "Gate the flattening rename on both world AND pack era, not world alone (#46)",
                details: "BlockStateModelRenderer's flattenLegacyBlockState call (and ExtendedBlock's\nmatching one for occlusion) fired on block.isLegacy() alone -- the WORLD\nchunk's era -- with no opinion on which resource pack was actually loaded.\nAgainst a modern pack that is exactly right (it's the fix render-1-12.mjs's\nKNOWN_LEGACY_RENDER_GAPS records). Against a real, era-matched 1.12.2 pack it\nruns backwards: it renamed the already-correct \"minecraft:grass\" into\n\"minecraft:grass_block\", a name that did not exist before the 1.13\nflattening, so the era-matched pack resolved it to nothing and the block\nwas skipped in total silence. Verified numbers from\ntools/oracle/render-1-12-era-matched.mjs, pre-fix: 0 grass-family vertices,\ndirt at 43.6% of the render vs 4.3% on the modern-pack control -- the ground\nwas no longer occluded from above because the grass never got drawn.\n\nBoth call sites now also check ResourcePack#isLegacy() (new), which asks\nevery registered extension generically via a new ResourcePackExtension.isLegacy\nhook rather than importing LegacyResourcePackExtension.ts by name -- the\ndirect-lookup version was tried first and closed a require-cycle back through\nExtendedBlock.ts onto ResourcePack.ts before that class had finished defining\nitself (a TypeError caught and reworked before ever reaching a commit, not a\nregression anyone will hit). The rename now fires only when the world is\npre-flattening AND the pack is not.\n\ntools/oracle/render-1-12-era-matched.mjs gained the two assertions that were\nmissing entirely -- before this it only logged FINDING lines and reported\nok:true even with zero grass vertices, so nothing was really \"the failing\ncheck\" until now. It also had the wrong texture names on file\n(blocks/grass_normal, blocks/grass_snowed, which are the 1.12.2 jar's MODEL\nfilenames, not textures); the real ones, read from the cached jar, are\nblocks/grass_top, grass_side, grass_side_overlay and grass_side_snowed.\n\nAll three required checks pass with the fix in place:\n- render-1-12-era-matched.mjs: 4/4 checks pass (91,944 grass-family vertices,\n  dirt down to 10.2% from 43.6%, within tolerance of the 4.3% control)\n- render-1-12.mjs: 14/14 checks pass, byte-identical to its modern-pack\n  control (the rename still fires there, unaffected)\n- compare.mjs --seed 7 --size 200: RESULT: identical (the modern-world gate\n  never reaches the pack-era check at all, since block.isLegacy() is false)\n\nExtends FlatteningRename.test.ts and blockRenderers.test.ts with the era\nmatrix: legacy world + modern pack = rename fires, legacy world + era-matched\npack = rename does not fire, modern world + any pack = rename does not fire.\nConfirmed the two new era-matched cases fail against the old world-only gate\nbefore restoring the fix.\n\n一個世界年代就話事,好心你都問吓個 pack 先啦\n\nBlockStateModelRenderer 個 flattenLegacyBlockState,同 ExtendedBlock 嗰個攞\nocclusion 用嘅孖生兄弟,淨係睇 block.isLegacy()——即係個世界(chunk)舊唔\n舊——完全唔理你今次用緊咩 resource pack,一係就自把自為咁郁手。對住 modern\npack 呢個係啱嘅(render-1-12.mjs 嘅 KNOWN_LEGACY_RENDER_GAPS 已經清咗嘛)。\n但係對住一個「年代啱」嘅真 1.12.2 pack,佢就反咗轉頭做:將本身冇問題嘅\n\"minecraft:grass\" 硬係改名做 \"minecraft:grass_block\"——呢個名喺 1.13 flattening\n之前根本未出世過——搞到個 era-matched pack 揾唔到,個 block 靜雞雞咁完全冇畫\n出嚟。修之前嘅真實數字(tools/oracle/render-1-12-era-matched.mjs):草地材質\nvertex 數 0,dirt 佔成個 render 43.6%,對比 modern pack 對照組得返 4.3%——即係\n話樹頂唔再擋住地下,乜都畀你望晒穿。\n\n而家兩個位都會加埋問 ResourcePack#isLegacy()(新加嘅),用新加嘅\nResourcePackExtension.isLegacy 呢個通用 hook 逐個問哂已註冊嘅 extension,唔係\n點名 import LegacyResourcePackExtension.ts——因為直接咁做本來會兜返個圈,經\nExtendedBlock.ts 兜番去 ResourcePack.ts 度,喺個 class 都未定義完就搶住用\n(呢個 TypeError 喺未 commit 之前已經捉到同改好,唔會有人踩中)。而家個\nrename 淨係喺「世界舊 AND pack 唔舊」先至郁手。\n\ntools/oracle/render-1-12-era-matched.mjs 之前得個講字,淨係印 FINDING 行,\n草地材質零條都照樣報 ok:true——依家先真係加返個「唔啱就 fail」嘅斷言。仲有,\n之前個劇本抄錯咗材質名(blocks/grass_normal、blocks/grass_snowed——嗰啲其實\n係 1.12.2 jar 嘅 MODEL 檔名,唔係材質名);真身係 blocks/grass_top、\ngrass_side、grass_side_overlay 同 grass_side_snowed,直接對住個 jar 查證過。\n\n三個要求嘅檢查而家全部通過:\n- render-1-12-era-matched.mjs:4/4 全過(91,944 條草地材質 vertex,dirt 由\n  43.6% 跌返落 10.2%,喺 4.3% 對照組嘅容忍範圍入面)\n- render-1-12.mjs:14/14 全過,同 modern-pack 對照組一模一樣\n- compare.mjs --seed 7 --size 200:RESULT: identical(modern 世界成隻都唔會\n  行到個 pack-年代 check 度,因為 block.isLegacy() 一開波就係 false)\n\n同時幫 FlatteningRename.test.ts 同 blockRenderers.test.ts 加埋「年代矩陣」:\n舊世界+現代 pack=要改名;舊世界+年代啱嘅 pack=唔改;現代世界+隨便邊個\npack=唔改。已經證實呢兩條新加嘅 era-matched test 用返舊嘅(得世界年代)\ngate 會 fail,跟住先復原個修法確認變返 pass。",
