                subject: "Record Phase C's exit-check disposition: 2 pass, 1 finds a real defect (issue #31)",
                details: "design/ROADMAP.md's Phase C section and phase-summary row, and\ndesign/HANDOFF.md's top plain-language stamp and legacy-render section, now\nrecord the honest, dated result of running all three exit checks:\n\n- textures.json semantic parity: PASS for vanilla 1.21 (1723/1723), modded\n  still unproven (no legitimate pack reachable under this task's Mojang-only\n  network policy).\n- the live end-to-end minecraft:grass_block resolution: PASS, run for real\n  against a freshly downloaded, SHA-1-verified 1.21 jar.\n- a real 1.12.2 jar through the legacy compat path: the path itself works\n  (pack loads, five real pre-flattening blockstates resolve to real texture\n  pixels) but the render built on top of it does not for an era-matched\n  deployment -- filed as issue #46.\n\n\"Ported\" stays the accurate word for Phase C, not \"Done\", and issue #31 stays\nopen with these results attached rather than closed.\n\n記低 Phase C 三個驗收檢查嘅老實結果:兩個過咗,一個搵到真.問題\n\ndesign/ROADMAP.md 嘅 Phase C 段同總表,同埋 design/HANDOFF.md 嘅頭段摘要\n同舊 legacy-render 章節,而家都記低咗三個檢查真係跑完之後嘅老實(有日期)\n結果:textures.json 語意相等,vanilla 過咗(1723/1723),modded 果邊因為\n呢個任務嘅網絡限制搵唔到合法 pack,依然未證實;live 端到端解析 grass_block,\n用真.下載、驗過 SHA-1 嘅 1.21 jar 跑過,過咗;真.1.12.2 jar 行 legacy\ncompat path,個 path 本身冇問題(pack 揾到、五個真.舊式 blockstate 解得\n啱),但架喺上面嗰個 render 對住「年代啱」嘅部署就唔啱,已經開咗 issue\n#46 追蹤。\n\nPhase C 依然係「移植咗」,唔係「做完」,issue #31 亦都繼續開住,附埋今次\n嘅結果,唔會閂。",
                category: "docs",
