                subject: "Find the real bug behind a test left honestly red: TabGroupPicker's own trap was fine",
                details: "GROUP 4 asked to extend TabGroupPicker.vue's Tab trap to cover the\nteleported regex-builder popover. That work was already done and correct\n- openBuilderElements, trapAcrossBuilder and the document-level\nonDocumentKeydown listener all landed in earlier commits, including a\nrefinement (f8e8283) that stops the trap double-handling a boundary press\nv-menu had already resolved. What was left, and what that same commit's\nown message documented as an unexplained red test, was one assertion in\ntabGroupPickerMount.test.ts that passed alone and failed only when the\nfull 19-test file ran together.\n\nThe cause was a leak in the test file, not a defect in the component.\nmountPicker() - the helper roughly fourteen of this file's tests use -\nnever called wrapper.unmount(), so every one of those tests left its own\nTabGroupPicker instance's document-level keydown trap attached to the\nshared jsdom document for the rest of the file's run. By the time \"Tab,\nwith the teleported regex builder open\" ran, up to fourteen stale traps\nwere listening on the same keydown, each one reading the same live,\ncorrectly-open popover and each moving document.activeElement one further\nstep than the last - which is exactly why the middle-of-popover case\nlanded on one of the trailing \"Copy the pattern\" / \"Copy the flags\"\nbuttons rather than one step past where it started, and exactly why\nisolation never reproduced it: nothing to leak yet with only one mount.\nmountPicker now routes through a tracked mount that this file's own\nafterEach always unmounts, whether or not the test itself remembers to.\n20/20 tests pass, repeatably, run alone or as the full file, checked\nacross several full-file runs rather than once. Full tabs/ suite: 187/187.\n\nThe stale \"KNOWN RESIDUAL, left honestly red\" comment is rewritten in\nplace with the actual cause and what it was mistaken for at the time,\nrather than deleted, so the trail from confirmed-unexplained to\nfound-and-fixed stays readable.\n\nA red test told the truth about not knowing why. It just did not yet know\nwhere to look - four hundred lines up, in its own cleanup.\n\n粵語：GROUP 4 叫做將 TabGroupPicker.vue 個 Tab trap 伸展到都包埋\nteleport 咗出去嗰個 regex-builder popover。呢樣嘢其實早就做咗,做得仲啱\n——openBuilderElements、trapAcrossBuilder 同個 document 層級嘅\nonDocumentKeydown 監聽全部都喺之前嘅 commit 度落咗地,仲有一手執到\n(f8e8283)專門補冧一個 trap 重複處理 v-menu 自己已經搞掂咗嘅邊界揿掣嘅\n情況。剩返嘅,就係嗰個 commit 自己都寫低講「解釋唔到」嘅一條紅 test:\ntabGroupPickerMount.test.ts 入面一條斷言,單獨行冇事,但成個 19 條 test\n嘅檔案一齊行就會錯。\n\n真正原因係個 test file 自己漏嘢,唔係組件本身有問題。mountPicker() ——\n呢個檔案大概十四條 test 用緊嘅 helper —— 從來冇叫過 wrapper.unmount(),\n搞到每一條用佢嘅 test 都留低自己個 TabGroupPicker 實例嘅 document 層級\nkeydown trap,一直賴喺個共用嘅 jsdom document 度,直到成個檔案行完。到\n「Tab, with the teleported regex builder open」嗰陣,可能有成十四個\n賴死唔走嘅 trap 一齊監聽緊同一個 keydown,每一個都讀緊同一個真係開緊嘅\npopover,每一個都將 document.activeElement 郁多一步——呢個就係點解個\n「popover 中間」case 會停喺尾嗰兩粒掣(\"Copy the pattern\"/\"Copy the\nflags\")度,而唔係啱啱行多一步;亦都係點解淨係嗰條 test 自己行就完全\n重現唔到——得一個 mount,冇嘢好漏。而家 mountPicker 行緊一個有track住嘅\nmount,呢個檔案自己嘅 afterEach 會保證全部 unmount 返,唔理個 test 自己\n記唔記得做。20 條 test 全部過,單獨行定成個檔案一齊行都係,重複行過幾次\n先信得過。成個 tabs/ suite:187/187。",
