                details: "Issue #32 requirement 1 named \"renderstate\" explicitly; the earlier tests exercised\nhiresTiles and textures but never tileState/chunkState/regionState directly. Two tests\nclose that gap: the three render-state grids round-trip as gzip regardless of the\nmap's own tile compression (matching KeyedMapStorage's grid() call for each), stay\naddressed by distinct keys so they cannot collide with hires tiles at the same (x, z),\nand markers/players/settings round-trip uncompressed, exactly as upstream's\nKeyedMapStorage wires every sub-storage's compression.\n\nstorage/sql:補埋 render-state grid 同成日唔壓縮嘅 markers/players 嘅測試\n\nIssue #32 嘅要求 1 明明講咗「renderstate」,之前啲 test 淨係測過 hiresTiles 同\ntextures,冇直接測過 tileState/chunkState/regionState。加返兩個 test:三個\nrender-state grid 唔理個 map 自己嘅 tile 用咩壓縮,佢哋自己一定係 gzip(同\nKeyedMapStorage 幫每個 grid() 叫嘅嘢一致),仲用唔同嘅 key 分開,唔會同 hires tile\n喺同一個 (x, z) 撞埋一齊;markers/players/settings 就一定係唔壓縮咁 round-trip,同\n上游 KeyedMapStorage 幫每個 sub-storage 駁壓縮嘅方式一樣。",
