                subject: "Bridge and mount automatic repair diagnostics",
                details: "registerRepairHandlers was registered in main/index.ts and fully\nunit-tested (102 tests: diagnosis, guardrails, the agent pass,\nredaction, the IPC channels themselves) against a fake IpcMain, and\nnothing in the running app ever called repair:agent, repair:failures,\nrepair:diagnose or repair:run - no preload method, no renderer code.\nThe deterministic port-conflict/no-Java/out-of-memory/config-rejected\ndiagnosis and the guardrailed local-agent repair pass this project\nbuilt had no door in either.\n\nAdded a repair namespace to the preload, additively, covering exactly\nthose four channels. Mounted RepairPanel.vue as a new Diagnostics tab\nin Settings, next to the version-history tab this same sweep added:\nagent availability, the list of failures on record, and Diagnose/\nRepair per failure, each showing the real diagnosis message, remedy,\napplied changes and history report main/repair/pass.ts produces.\n\nHonest gap, the same shape docs/config-history.md already states for\nthe profile-list and settings histories: repair:remember - the call\nthat actually puts a failure on record - is not yet wired into the\nrender or web-server failure paths (main/render/orchestrator.ts and\nfriends), because that evidence (config snapshots, Java version,\nDocker state, the exact command) only exists deep inside the runner,\nand reaching it from here would be a substantially larger change than\nthis commit. So the Diagnostics tab starts out honestly empty rather\nthan showing an invented failure to look busier than it is; it fills\nthe moment that separate wiring lands.\n\nregisterRepairHandlers喺main/index.ts度register咗，仲有102個test足晒\n（診斷、guardrails、agent pass、遮蔽敏感資料、IPC channel本身），用假嘅\nIpcMain度測到足；但係行緊嗰個app從來冇叫過repair:agent、\nrepair:failures、repair:diagnose定係repair:run，preload冇方法，\nrenderer冇code。呢個project起咗嘅「port衝突/冇Java/爆記憶體/config\n畀拒絕」判斷同埋有guardrail嘅本機agent修復流程，都係企喺度冇門入。\n\n喺preload度加返個repair namespace，乜都冇拆舊嘢，四條channel一一\n對應。喺Settings開多條「診斷」分頁，擺喺呢次一齊加嘅版本記錄分頁隔籬：\nagent有冇裝、已經記錄咗嘅失敗清單、每個失敗嘅診斷同修復掣，show埋\nmain/repair/pass.ts真係計出嚟嘅診斷、修復方案、改咗啲乜、歷史記錄。\n\n呢度老實講仲有個窿，同docs/config-history.md講嘅profile清單同settings\n記錄嗰個窿一個款：repair:remember——真正將失敗記落紀錄嗰個call——\n都仲未接入render或者web server嘅失敗路徑（main/render/orchestrator.ts\n嗰班），因為嗰啲證據（config snapshot、Java版本、Docker狀態、行緊嗰條\ncommand）淨係喺runner入面先有，由呢度去攞會係一個大好多嘅改動。所以\n「診斷」分頁而家會老老實實咁企喺度話未有記錄，而唔係作一個假失敗嚟扮\n好忙，等嗰單獨立嘅wiring接埋佢就會有嘢喇。",
