                subject: "Bridge and mount Bedrock world detection and conversion",
                details: "registerBedrockHandlers existed, was fully unit-tested against a fake\nIpcMain, and was never called from the running app - no main-process\nregistration, no preload method, no renderer code, so the whole\nBedrock-to-Java conversion feature had no way in. A concurrent change\nalready registered it in main/index.ts; this closes the other two\ngaps. Added a bedrock namespace to the preload, additively, covering\ndetect, chunkerStatus, fetchChunker, convert, cancel and\nonBedrockEvent exactly as main/bedrock/ipc.ts registers them.\n\nMounted the entry point where docs/bedrock-worlds.md says it belongs:\nthe wizard's own first step. BedrockConversionNote.vue watches the\nfolder being typed, calls the read-only bedrock:detect the moment a\nfolder settles, and - only for a folder that really is a Bedrock world\n- shows the fidelity briefing, the memory warning when the world is\nlarge enough to matter, and a Convert button that runs Chunker and\nhands the wizard the finished Java copy to inspect like any other\nfolder. Nothing here converts anything as a side effect of looking at\na folder, matching the subsystem's own rule.\n\nOne real bug the tests caught before it shipped: bedrock:convert's own\nid is only reported back when the invoke resolves, which is exactly\nwhen the conversion is already over, so a naive read of it would leave\nthe mid-conversion Cancel button unable to reach the right process.\nFixed by adopting the id from the first progress event instead, which\nthe main process broadcasts from the moment the conversion starts.\n\nregisterBedrockHandlers response喺主進程度，仲用假嘅IpcMain度足晒\ntesting，點知行緊嗰個app從來冇叫過佢：主進程冇register，preload冇方法，\nrenderer冇code，成個Bedrock轉Java嘅功能就咁企喺度冇門入。有個並行嘅\n改動已經喺main/index.ts度register咗，呢次補返餘低兩個窿。喺preload度\n加返個bedrock namespace，乜都冇拆舊嘢，detect、chunkerStatus、\nfetchChunker、convert、cancel、onBedrockEvent，同main/bedrock/ipc.ts\n註冊嗰啲一一對應。\n\n入口就擺喺docs/bedrock-worlds.md話應該擺嘅地方：wizard第一步。\nBedrockConversionNote.vue睇住個人打緊嘅資料夾，一停低就叫嗰個唯讀嘅\nbedrock:detect，真係Bedrock世界先至出嚟，show埋fidelity briefing、\n夠大先出嘅記憶體警告，仲有個Convert掣叫Chunker去做，做完就將個Java\n版交返畀wizard，同揀返嚟嘅資料夾一樣咁查。冇嘢會因為睇一眼個資料夾就\n自動幫你轉。\n\n測試出貨前捉到一個真Bug：bedrock:convert自己嗰個id要等個invoke resolve\n先答你，但嗰陣轉換都做完㗎喇，所以你想喺轉緊嗰陣撳Cancel，個Cancel\n掣其實搵唔到轉緊嗰個process。而家改咗做由第一個progress event度攞返個\nid，因為主進程一開始轉就即刻broadcast嗰個event。",
