                subject: "Refresh 34 documentation screenshots from a live capture of the current build",
                details: "Every image was retaken by the project's own Playwright harness\n(design/packages/app/test/screenshots.spec.ts) against a fresh UI/app build at\ncommit 649869166cf58a84d1643d238dea2eda222ca41e, driven headless so the\ncapture never touched anyone's visible desktop. None is hand-edited, resized,\nor reused from an older run.\n\nGetting one clean run out of a shared, heavily loaded machine took real\ndebugging, not luck: a manually reconstructed electron/path.txt carried a\nstray trailing newline from `echo`, which corrupted the resolved electron.exe\npath just enough to make Electron print its own usage text instead of\nlaunching - `electron.launch()` then hung until Playwright's hook timeout,\nwith no error pointing anywhere useful. Rewriting that file with `printf`\n(no newline) fixed it outright. Separately, under sustained 80-100% CPU\ncontention from other agents on this machine, the harness's own first-run\ndialog sometimes mounted after its 20-second detection window, leaving an\norphaned blocking modal that silently broke every later click in that worker;\nsetting the harness's own documented MATERIAL_BLUEMAP_ACCEPT_DOWNLOAD=1\nescape hatch for dev/CI machines avoided the race entirely. Both are recorded\nin this repository's shared agent memory so nobody re-discovers them the\nhard way.\n\nThe remaining ~27 tracked images that need the viewer's control bar (menu,\nsettings-drawer sub-sections beyond the one captured, options-editor tabs,\nthe delete gate, the reset-settings gate) could not be refreshed this pass:\nacross five full attempts the map never finished its first WebGL frame\ninside the harness's own time budget under that same sustained load, and the\ncontrol bar does not mount without one. Those images are left exactly as\nthey were; nothing was substituted for them.\n\n刷新 34 張文檔截圖,靚仔靚女嘅 Playwright 機器人親自出馬,對住啱啱先起爐嘅\nbuild 影相,連隔離桌面都用埋,唔會嚇親你部機。影相之前捉咗兩隻蟲:一係手抄\nelectron 嘅 path.txt 用 echo 唔小心加咗個換行符,搞到 Electron 睇到嗰條路徑\n就以為你想睇說明書,企喺度唔郁,連 Playwright 都等到眼訓;二係呢部機成日\n畀第啲機器人焗到 80% 到 100% CPU,首次執行畫面遲咗先彈出嚟,執行框留喺度\n擋晒後面嘅撳掣,搞到成個 worker 廢晒 - 開返個官方畀嘅開發者開關就搞掂。\n淨返嗰廿七張要靠地圖畫完先睇到嘅控制列(選單、設定入面幾個分頁、config\n編輯器嘅分頁、刪除閘、重設閘),試足五鋪都畀成部機嘅負荷拖到冇畫完,冇畫\n就冇條控制列,所以呢批相原封不動,冇偷龍轉鳳。",
