                subject: "server: drive the real RenderManager from a map-update request",
                details: "Adds RenderDriver and its HTTP surface RenderUpdateHandler\n(POST/GET /maps/{id}/update). This is the first place outside\npackages/engine that constructs a real MapUpdateTask and hands it to a real\nRenderManager (issue #29): triggerUpdate calls upstream's own\nMapUpdatePreparationTask.updateMap(map, renderManager) - the exact function a\nplugin command calls - and schedules the real preparation task on the real\nmanager. No region discovery, task construction or scheduling logic is\nreimplemented; every rule that decides that stays in packages/engine. Status\ncomes from RenderManager's own bookkeeping (ProgressTracker by way of\nestimateCurrentRenderTaskTimeRemaining), never invented. Upstream's web\nserver has no equivalent route - it never triggers a render over HTTP, only\nfrom a plugin command or a file-watch - so this is a documented Material\nBlueMap addition, not a deviation from something upstream does.\n\nThe test constructs a real BmMap, a real bare ResourcePack and a real\n(unmocked) RenderManager, then asserts real tile files land in a real\nFileMapStorage - unlike packages/engine's own rendertasks.test.ts, which\nmocks HiresModelManager away specifically to avoid this cost, and so never\nactually proves the pieces work together. Getting a fake World past the real\nHiresModelManager (rather than the mocked one rendertasks.test.ts drives)\nneeded three more methods rendertasks.test.ts's fixture never had to\nimplement - getDimensionType, getChunkAtBlock, iterateEntities - the exact\nthree the real block/entity render passes call and the mock never did. Also\ncorrects an assumption the driver's own doc comment made and a test asserted\non faith: neither MapUpdatePreparationTask nor MapUpdateTask overrides\n`equals`, so two independent triggers for the same map are NOT deduplicated\nby RenderManager's queue-containment check - both get scheduled, verified\nagainst the real manager rather than left as an untested claim.\n\nRefs #41, refs #29.\n\n一句講晒:由 packages/server 度真金白銀起一個 MapUpdateTask,\n交俾真身 RenderManager 去行,唔係紙上談兵。跟住拆穿咗自己畀自己\n寫嘅一個大話:仲以為兩次觸發會被擋咗第二次,原來 MapUpdatePreparationTask\n根本冇覆寫 equals,兩次一樣咁排隊,而家個 test 同註解都改返做老實人。\n仲有,為咗畀個假世界撞得過真身 HiresModelManager(唔係 rendertasks.test.ts\n嗰個扮嘢版),要幫個 fake world 加多三個方法先得,一個都冇少得。",
