                details: "screenshots.spec.ts's \"History\" step (and the tab-iterating \"Options\neditor tabs\" step beside it) queried `.v-tab` and `.mb-config-screen__window`,\nboth from before ConfigScreen's tab strip became the custom\nTabbedNavigation/TabButton component. Neither class exists in the\nrendered output any more, so the click and the panel-visibility wait\neach ran out their full 15s doing nothing, \"History\" never got its\nrequired capture, and the harness's own REQUIRED_SURFACES gate would\nhave failed in CI for a reason that had nothing to do with issue #34's\nactual fix. Repointed all three occurrences at the real `[role=\"tab\"]`\ntab and the real `.mb-tabs__panel[role=\"tabpanel\"]` content region,\nscoped under `.mb-config-screen__tabs` so they can't cross-match the\napplication's outer tab strip. Verified against the real Electron app\nthrough the real harness: History, Projects, CI-render, EULA and Pages\npublishing all now capture for real, and the required-surface\nassertion passes.\n\nIssue #36 asked whether a backup made by this application actually\nrestores through Desktop Material and back, not just whether the text\nmatches its grammar. Desktop Material exists on the verifying machine\nand does share the exact canonical Cheap LFS v1 pointer format and a\nrelease-asset backend, so the round trip is not blocked by the other\napplication being unavailable — but actually running it, in both\ndirections, over both pointer shapes, against real GitHub releases, is\na substantial cross-project integration effort the issue itself\nrecognises as its own piece of work. Taking Outcome B, which the issue\nexplicitly sanctions: docs/backup.md, ROADMAP.md's Backups row,\npointer.test.ts's doc comment, and every place in the interface that\nsaid a backup made here \"is readable there\" now say what was actually\nproven — format conformance, permanently — instead of the stronger,\nunproven claim.\n\nscreenshots.spec.ts 嗰個 History 步驟(仲有隔籬嗰個成個逐個掃嘅 Options\neditor tabs)一直揀緊 `.v-tab` 同 `.mb-config-screen__window`,兩個都係\nconfig screen 個分頁改用 TabbedNavigation 之前嘅舊寫法,而家個渲染結果\n入面根本冇呢兩個 class,於是撳掣同等 panel 出現嗰步各自苦等 15 秒然後\n乜都冇做過,History 一直影唔到,harness 自己嗰個 REQUIRED_SURFACES 關卡\n本身喺 CI 度就會爆,但爆嘅原因同 #34 個真正修好嘅嘢完全冇關係。三處\n全部改番用真係存在嘅 `[role=\"tab\"]` 分頁掣同 `.mb-tabs__panel[role=\"tabpanel\"]`\n內容區,仲局限咗喺 `.mb-config-screen__tabs` 之內,唔會撞正個大 app\n自己嗰條分頁列。用真正嘅 Electron app 經真 harness 驗證過:History、\nProjects、CI-render、EULA、Pages publishing 而家全部影到真嘢,required\nsurface 嗰個斷言都過。\n\nIssue #36 問嘅係喺呢度整嘅備份係咪真係喺 Desktop Material 度過到、\n返到轉頭,唔淨係文字啱唔啱規則。驗證機度真係有 Desktop Material,而且\n佢用緊嘅正正就係同一個 Cheap LFS v1 pointer 格式同 release-asset 後端,\n所以唔係「隔籬 app 攞唔到」呢個原因擋住個來回測試 —— 但要真係行一次\n雙向、兩種 pointer 形狀、對住真 GitHub release,係一大舊獨立嘅跨專案\n整合工程,issue 本身都認呢個係佢自己嘅一份工。而家揀 issue 明文批准嘅\nOutcome B:docs/backup.md、ROADMAP.md 嘅 Backups 行、pointer.test.ts\n嘅文件註解,仲有介面入面所有講「呢度整嘅喺嗰邊都讀得到」嘅地方,而家\n統一講返實際驗證過嘅嘢 —— 永久嘅格式合規,唔再講嗰個未證實過嘅強宣稱。",
