                subject: "Bridge and mount browse/restore for the profile-list and settings histories",
                details: "registerProfilesHistoryHandlers and registerAppSettingsHistoryHandlers\nwere registered and fully tested on the main-process side, but nothing\ncrossed the bridge: no preload method, no renderer code, so a deleted\nprofile or a lost setting had a real history sitting behind it with no\ndoor in. Added profilesHistory/appSettingsHistory to the preload,\nadditively, exposing exactly what main/profiles/ipc.ts and\nmain/settings/ipc.ts actually register: read, save, list, restore.\n\nReusing HistoryPanel.vue outright was not an option: it is built for a\nconfig folder's eight-method history (search, dates, actions, compare,\nper-setting restore, discarding older revisions) and refuses to mount\non a bridge missing any of them, which these two genuinely lack today\nper docs/config-history.md. Built SimpleHistoryList.vue instead - the\nsame HistoryRevisionRow list-and-restore shape, sized to what is really\nthere - and gave HistoryRevisionRow an additive `labellable` prop so it\nstops offering a label control this host has no channel for. Mounted\nboth browsers in a new \"History\" tab in Settings, reachable and tested\nthe way every other tab there is.\n\nHonest gap, matching docs/config-history.md's own staged plan: nothing\nhere calls profilesHistory:save or settingsHistory:save from the\nplaces that actually change a profile or a setting yet - profiles.ts,\nappearanceStore.ts and the rest still write only localStorage - so\nthis tab starts out showing \"no revisions yet\" until that separate,\nlarger migration lands. What was built today is the door; the traffic\nthrough it is the next piece.\n\n早排就response registerProfilesHistoryHandlers同settings嗰個都testing足晒，\n主進程嗰邊靚仔到痺，點知條橋一格都冇搭，preload乜方法都冇，人哋刪咗個\nprofile，背後明明有歷史記錄，佢哋自己就係入唔到門。而家喺preload度加返\nprofilesHistory/appSettingsHistory，齊晒read/save/list/restore，一啲舊\n嘢都冇拆。\n\n原本諗住照抄HistoryPanel.vue，點知佢係為config folder嗰八招歷史起\n（搜尋、日期、動作、比較、逐個setting還原、篩走舊版本），少一招都唔開\n工，而依家呢兩份歷史根本未有嗰幾招。所以起咗個SimpleHistoryList.vue，\n用返HistoryRevisionRow嗰套「睇清單、撳還原」，size啱先至起，仲畀\nHistoryRevisionRow加咗個labellable，冇label channel就唔好扮嘢出個掣。\n喺Settings開多條「版本記錄」分頁載埋兩個browser，同其他分頁一樣，實牙\n實齒開得到。\n\n老實講，呢度仲有個窿：真正儲存個profile、個setting嗰啲地方——\nprofiles.ts、appearanceStore.ts嗰班——依然淨係寫緊localStorage，未叫過\nprofilesHistory:save/settingsHistory:save，所以呢頁而家會見到「暫時未有\n記錄」，跟docs/config-history.md自己講嘅分階段計劃一樣誠實。今日起咗嗰\n道門；行唔行到人就係下一步嘅嘢。",
