                details: "Bulk delete's two-key gate authorized synchronously and NoticeBulkToolbar\ndeleted the selected notifications and cleared the selection in that same\ntick. Its own \"Delete N selected\" button is gated by\ndeleteImp.changingCount > 0, which the deletion itself immediately zeroed,\ntearing the still-open ConfigSuperConfirm gate out of the DOM before a\nsingle frame of \"Authorized.\" could be seen and firing the gate's own\nreturnFocusTo into a button that no longer existed. runDelete now defers\nits mutation by the same GATE_COMPLETION_HOLD_MS the gate itself holds\nfor, and moves focus to the toolbar's own status region afterward, since\nthe button the gate would have refocused is gone by then.\n\nDismiss's and export's honest-preview sentences existed only inside a\nv-tooltip, which Vuetify does not mount until the activator is hovered or\nfocused - not something a reader deciding whether to press the button\ncould see just by looking at the panel. Both are now permanently visible\nparagraphs, matching how the delete gate's own action text and the\nexclusion list already work. Mark-as-read's own exclusion note\n(noticeBulk.excludedMarkRead) was called from the template with a\nfallback string but was never actually registered in the copy catalogue;\nit is now, additively, in the same shape as its three sibling exclusion\nnotes.\n\n刪除嗰兩條匙帶掣一撳到尾就即刻批准,批准嗰陣間宣布「批准咗」嘅卡仲未畫得\n切,個掣自己就因為冇嘢好刪而消失咗,個焦點想返去嗰個掣,搵極都搵唔到。而家\n刪除動作會等夠成個完成停頓先至真係郁手,焦點就轉去嗰段一直都喺度嘅狀態文\n字。收埋同匯出嗰兩句解釋句,本來淨係匿埋喺個滑鼠移埋先出嘅提示入面,而家就\n擺晒出嚟俾人一眼見到。仲有,標記已讀嗰句剩低通知嘅解釋,原來一直用緊個冇註\n冊嘅字典鍵,今次終於補返落去。",
