                details: "AppSettings, ConfigScreen and ProjectEditor now carry their own TabbedNavigation\nunder their own storage keys; the shared doc only ever described App.vue's copy\nof it. Add a table naming every mounted surface and its key, document the new\nrenamePage host hook a live tab-count label needs, and record AppearanceEditor's\nthree fixed local tabs as a deliberate, reasoned exception rather than a gap\nnobody wrote down.\n\n補返文件冇講嘅嘢：AppSettings、ConfigScreen 同 ProjectEditor 而家都用緊自己嗰set\nTabbedNavigation、各自一條 storage key，之前份文件淨係識講 App.vue 嗰份。加咗個表\n列晒邊個 surface 用邊條 key,寫低 renamePage 呢個新 host hook 點解要有,亦都寫明\nAppearanceEditor 三個固定 local tabs係諗清楚先揀嘅例外,唔係漏低冇人記低嘅窿。",
