                subject: "Complete tabbed material surfaces and resumable Pages publishing",
                details: "The application now gives settings, config, project editing, and the published Pages surface real browser-style navigation, searchable copy, and durable resume/status checkpoints. The copy catalogue grows per surface with fact-preserving English and Hong Kong Cantonese levels, while the changelog generator keeps private conversational shorthand out of its public output. The old UI was not evil; it was simply a long scroll wearing a tab-shaped hat.\\n\\n設定、config、project editor 同 Pages publishing 而家都有真正 browser-style tabs、搜尋同持久化 resume/status checkpoint；每個 surface 嘅英語同香港粵語 copy 都守住事實，changelog 產生器亦會將私人口語留喺 commit history，唔帶入公開輸出。舊 UI 唔係衰，只係一條長長嘅 scroll 戴住 tab 形狀頂帽扮嘢。",
