                subject: "Show the map hosted on Pages, with the evidence and the trap",
                details: "The README advertised CI rendering and stopped at the artifact. Hosting the\nresult is the obvious next question, and the answer has a trap in it worth\nwriting down where somebody will meet it.\n\nIncludes the screenshot of the tiny probe world served from\ndingdingchae.github.io, the two-line proof that the gzipped tile URL returns 200\nwhile the plain one returns 404, and what Pages will refuse: a map in parts, a\nsite over a gigabyte, a file over a hundred megabytes.\n\n份 README 講完 CI 砌圖就停喺個 artifact 度,但人人下一句都係「咁點擺出嚟俾人睇?」\n而家連埋張實測相、兩行證據,同埋 Pages 唔收咩都寫晒。",
