                shortSha: "f7b2b7fa6d",
                date: "2026-08-04T19:13:11-04:00",
                subject: "Add guarded GitHub Pages map hosting",
                details: "Give CI Render a deliberate Pages checkbox and preserve the end-to-end publisher that prepares a static map, stages it in an application-owned Git directory, checks the marker before replacement, enables Pages, polls the real build state, and probes the published URL before calling it live. The UI explains the parts limitation instead of pretending a split world is one neat upload.\\n\\nCI Render 而家有個要人手揀嘅 Pages checkbox，仲保留完整 publisher：先整 static map、用 app 自己個 Git directory、換之前驗 marker、開 Pages、輪詢真實 build state，最後 probe URL 先敢叫 live。地圖太大要分 parts 就直講，唔扮一包過咁瀟灑。",
