                details: "Wire the static-host preparation into the Render World Pages path, expose the CLI command, and let GitHub API sends handle empty 204 responses as well as JSON replies. The map no longer arrives at GitHub Pages wearing server-only shoes, and the API helper stops demanding a receipt from a DELETE that quite reasonably hands back nothing.\\n\\nRender World 條 Pages 路線而家會先整好 plain-file host 要嘅 map，CLI 都有 static-host command；GitHub API send 亦識處理空白 204，唔會要求 DELETE 交份不存在嘅收據。幅地圖唔再著住只識 server 嘅鞋去 Pages，API helper 亦唔再為零字回覆發脾氣。",
