                subject: "Fix static-host summary mutation",
                details: "The walker increments its byte and file totals while visiting the tree, so those counters must be mutable even though the oversized-file list stays read-only. The type checker caught the accountant wearing an immutable nametag; now the tally can move without turning the rest of the report into soup.\\n\\n行緊個 tree 就要加 bytes 同 files，呢兩個數唔可以扮 readonly；oversized list 照樣唔畀換牌。之前個會計戴住「唔准改」名牌，一數數就俾 tsc 捉到，而家可以正常加數，其他報告繼續企穩。",
