        entries: [
            {
                sha: "d30b2833afbeb8752f787762283eb1f8ff7634d7",
                shortSha: "d30b2833af",
                date: "2026-08-03T19:16:08-04:00",
                subject: "Assert the maps folder's one true spelling through readdir, not exists()",
                details: "The case-spelling test wrote into a pre-existing `Maps/` and then\nprobed `exists(maps/overworld.conf)` in lowercase. On Windows that is\nthe same file and the probe says true; on the Linux CI runner it is a\ndifferent path and the probe says false. The assertion was testing the\nfilesystem's case-folding, not this module - the fourth test in this\nrepository to only pass where it was written, and the first to make\nthat mistake in the Windows-to-Linux direction.\n\nThe property the test exists to pin is real and unchanged: writing\n`maps/x.conf` beside an existing `Maps/` must land inside `Maps/` and\nmust not mint a second folder. That is now asserted the way it should\nhave been - read the directory listing and require exactly one\nmaps-spelled entry, `Maps`, with the file inside it - which is true on\nboth filesystems because it describes the module's behaviour rather\nthan the platform's.\n\n---\n\n隻 test 自己起咗個 `Maps/`，跟住用細楷 `maps/` 去 exists() 探路。\nWindows 話「有呀」因為佢根本唔分大細楷；Linux CI 話「冇喎」因為嗰度\n真係兩條唔同嘅路。個 assertion 測緊嘅係檔案系統識唔識 case-folding,\n唔係測緊自己嘅 module - 呢個 repo 第四單「喺邊度寫就only喺邊度綠」，\n仲要係第一單掉轉方向搞出嚟嘅。\n\n而家改用 readdir 睇清楚個資料夾入面究竟有幾多個 maps - 答案要係得\n一個、串法係 `Maps`、file 喺入面 - 兩個平台都啱，因為描述嘅係個\nmodule 點做嘢，唔係個平台點諗嘢。",
                category: "shell",
                areas: ["shell"],
                files: 1,
            },
            {
                sha: "f6e3099042d058fae7a6606813b44d574394aba4",
                shortSha: "f6e3099042",
                date: "2026-08-03T19:11:59-04:00",
                subject: "Open the doors the audit found painted shut, and build the bridge behind one",
                details: "A reachability audit walked every component from App.vue and every IPC\nchannel across all three layers, and found this project's signature\ndefect thriving: nine orphan components, two renderer-less features,\nand one bridge the options GUI has probed for since the day it was\nwritten that no process had ever built.\n\nThe config:* bridge now exists end to end. Seven channels in\nmain/config/ipc.ts with 75 tests: renderer-supplied names are checked\nbefore anything is joined (traversal, absolute forms in any spelling,\ndrive colons, NTFS streams, Windows device names - maps/CON.conf is the\nconsole, and writing to it succeeds while saving nothing), batches are\nall-or-nothing, symlinks are refused by name rather than followed, and\ntestSqlConnection is an honest feature-detected refusal because this\nbuild carries no SQL client and pretending otherwise would be a lie\nwith a green checkmark.\n\nConfigScreen - the seven-tab options workbench with zero importers, a\ndead barrel, and children tested only by tests that bypassed it - has\na door: a third shell FAB opens it full-bleed, Escape closes and\nreturns focus, and the wizard waits behind it inert instead of being\ntorn down. Notices moved to a shell-owned corner mounted once at v-app\nlevel. MarkerMenu's hand-rolled sort row became the MenuChoice it was\nre-implementing, and MenuChoice learned role=\"group\" and aria-pressed,\nbecause Vuetify marks selection with a class and a class is not\nsomething a screen reader can hear.\n\nThe dead wires are closed: firstRunFlow calls the storage method that\nexists rather than the one it wished existed, every ended render names\nthe engine that produced it with render.json preferred as evidence over\nexpectation, and in-flight renders surface beside interrupted ones\nwithout the two being conflated.\n\nMerged-tree verification: app 597 + ui 545 tests green, vue-tsc, tsc\nand eslint clean, both bundles built with the new channels present in\ndist.\n\n---\n\n隻 audit 由 App.vue 行落去逐個 component 點名，again 發現本 project 嘅\n招牌病：九個孤兒 component、兩個 feature 起晒橋冇人行、仲有個 options\nGUI 日日問「有冇 config bridge 呀」問咗咁耐，原來從來冇人起過。\n\n而家橋起好喇：七條 channel、75 個 test，改名靚仔先入閘 - 想 ../ 走上\n去？想寫落 maps/CON.conf 呃個 console？想跟 symlink 出走？全部門口\n截住。SQL 測試就老老實實話「呢個 build 冇 SQL client，測唔到」-\n綠剔唔係咁呃返嚟嘅。\n\nConfigScreen 七頁大工作枱，之前零 import、barrel 都係死嘅，啲仔女靠\n啲 test 繞過阿爸嚟探佢。而家有 FAB 有門口，Escape 識關門識還 focus,\n個 wizard 喺後面戙住等你唔會俾人拆咗。通知角搬咗去 shell 一個角落，\n唔會一個 toast 彈兩份。MarkerMenu 手作嗰排掣原來一直喺隔籬有現成嘅\nMenuChoice - 而家用返，仲順手教識佢 aria-pressed，因為 CSS class 讀\n屏器係聽唔到㗎。",
                category: "interface",
                areas: ["interface", "shell", "docs"],
                files: 27,
            }
        ],
