        entries: [
            {
                sha: "9f9177cd14f0541328c03a303a7fd1c16ad5825b",
                shortSha: "9f9177cd14",
                date: "2026-08-03T01:18:48-04:00",
                subject: "Stop the locale baseline from depending on which machine read the files",
                details: "The HOCON equivalence test passed on Windows and failed in CI for 27 of 30\nlocales. Nothing was wrong with the parser. This repository checks out with\ntext=auto, so the same .conf file is CRLF on a Windows working tree and LF on a\nLinux runner, and the parser preserves line endings verbatim inside multi-line\nstrings, which is correct. The baseline was captured on one platform, so every\nlocale carrying a multi-line HTML block encoded that platform's line endings and\ncould only ever match there. settings.conf passed precisely because it is the\none file with no multi-line block.\n\nBoth sides are now normalised to LF, so the test compares what the files say\nrather than which machine read them. The baseline fixture is rewritten with its\n2132 strings carriage-return free.\n\nWorth noting for anyone reading later: a test that only passes on the author's\noperating system is not a weaker test, it is a test that has not run anywhere\nelse, and the only reason this surfaced in minutes is that CI runs on a platform\nnobody develops on.\n\nHOCON 對照測試喺 Windows 度綠晒，一上 CI 三十個語言檔有二十七個紅。parser 冇問題。\n\n呢個 repo 用 text=auto，同一個 .conf 喺 Windows 係 CRLF、喺 Linux runner 係 LF；\n而 parser 喺多行字串入面原封不動保留換行符 — 呢個係啱嘅做法。個 baseline 係喺其中\n一部機錄嘅，於是凡係有多行 HTML 嘅語言檔，都連埋嗰部機嘅換行符一齊錄咗入去，變成\n淨係喺嗰部機先對得上。settings.conf 之所以係唯一過到嗰個，正正因為佢冇多行嘅嘢。\n\n而家兩邊一律正規化做 LF，個 test 比較嘅係啲檔案講咗乜，而唔係邊部機讀嘅。個\nbaseline 重寫過，2132 個字串一個 CR 都冇。\n\n順帶一提：一個淨係喺作者部機先過到嘅 test，唔係「無咁嚴謹」，係「根本未喺第二處\n行過」。今次幾分鐘就爆咗出嚟，唯一原因係 CI 行喺一個冇人喺度開發嘅平台。",
                category: "services",
                areas: ["services"],
                files: 2,
            },
            {
                sha: "bcb371913d18d366b0081088f47ae18eba11ab17",
                shortSha: "bcb371913d",
                date: "2026-08-03T01:14:58-04:00",
                subject: "Replace the eval-based HOCON parser so the UI can actually render",
                details: "Closes #16. hocon-parser resolves ${...} substitutions with eval, and the\nElectron shell ships a strict CSP with script-src 'self' and no unsafe-eval, so\nreading the language files threw EvalError, Vue mounted and rendered nothing,\nand the window stayed blank. The Vite build had been warning about that\ndependency the whole time.\n\nRelaxing the CSP was not an option worth taking: this app loads content from\nremote servers, and the hardened policy is a deliberate documented deviation\nfrom upstream. Precompiling the bundled locales to JSON would only have fixed\nhalf of it, because the viewer parses HOCON that arrives from a remote BlueMap\nserver at runtime, where no build step can reach.\n\nSo this is a hand-written HOCON subset parser with no dynamic code execution of\nany kind: no eval, no new Function, no setTimeout on a string, no import().\nA plain tokenizer and a recursive-descent parser, bounded on input size and\nnesting depth so a hostile .conf from a remote server fails with an error rather\nthan hanging or blowing the stack. ${...} substitution, the feature the old\nparser reached for eval to implement, is resolved structurally.\n\nThe equivalence test compares it against captured hocon-parser output for every\nbundled locale, and turned up something worth keeping: two of the thirty do not\nmatch, because hocon-parser did not treat U+00A0 as whitespace and silently\ndropped the blocks where a no-break space sat in the indentation. Those locales\nhave been quietly missing translations. The new parser reads them correctly, and\nthe test asserts the repair rather than the old behaviour.\n\nCloses #16。hocon-parser 要用 eval 去解 ${...}，而隻 app 個 CSP 就係唔准 eval，\n所以一讀語言檔就掟 EvalError，Vue 掛到起但畫唔到嘢，塊窗照白。Vite 一路都有出\nwarning 話呢個 library 用 eval，只係冇人擺埋一齊諗。\n\n放寬 CSP 唔抵：隻 app 會載遠端 server 嘅內容。將內置語言檔喺 build 時轉 JSON 又\n只醫一半，因為 viewer 要即時 parse 遠端 server 送嚟嘅 .conf，build step 伸唔到手。\n\n所以自己寫咗個 HOCON 子集 parser，**零動態執行**：冇 eval、冇 new Function、冇\n字串 setTimeout、冇 import()。純 tokenizer 加遞歸下降，輸入大細同巢狀深度都封晒\n頂，遠端寄條有毒嘅 .conf 過嚟只會報錯，唔會吊死或者爆 stack。\n\n順帶捉到條蟲：三十個語言檔有兩個對唔上，因為舊 parser 唔當 U+00A0 係空白，撞正\n縮排嗰度有個不換行空格，就靜靜雞成段吞咗。即係話嗰兩個語言一直缺緊翻譯。新 parser\n讀得返，而個 test 係釘住「修好之後」嘅結果，唔係釘住舊嗰個錯。",
                category: "services",
                areas: ["services", "build", "engine", "interface", "docs"],
                files: 11,
            }
        ],
