                details: "Every file in upstream's resources package is now ported and tested, and the\nengine went from 501 tests to 820. That is worth recording accurately, which\nalso means recording that Phase C's three exit criteria have not run: no\ntextures.json comparison against Java, no 1.12.2 jar through the legacy compat\npath, and no end-to-end grass_block resolution against a real downloaded client\njar. Marking the phase done on the strength of a green unit suite is exactly the\nmistake that let three phases ship an app whose interface had never rendered.\n\n成個 resources package port 晒、測試齊，engine 由 501 個 test 變 820 個，呢啲值得\n照實記低。同樣值得照實記低嘅係：Phase C 三條出關條件一條都未跑過 — 未同 Java 對\n過 textures.json、未用 1.12.2 個 jar 行過 legacy 路、未真係載個 1.21 client jar\n落嚟由頭到尾解一次 grass_block。\n\n淨係見 unit test 綠晒就寫「完成」，正正就係之前搞到三個 phase 都簽咗名、但隻 app\n個介面從來未出過嘅嗰個錯。",
